{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UfHWmWmXfEpJf3r3QsAbo9","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — meta_brain_lora_routing\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: CoRL 2026 (Austin, Nov 9-12)\n5\t- Abstract DDL: 2026-05-26\n6\t- Paper DDL: 2026-05-29\n7\t\n8\t## Core Insight\n9\t\n10\tVLA internal representations already encode rich perturbation-type-specific information (Phase 0: single-layer F1=1.0 at K=1), yet existing robustness methods either ignore this diagnostic signal entirely (VLA-GSE, RobustVLA) or only use it for detection without correction (SAFE). Meta-Brain closes the loop: diagnose perturbation type from frozen activations, then route to a type-specialized LoRA expert for targeted correction — achieving the \"right fix for the right failure\" at ~10x fewer parameters than perturbation-agnostic capacity routing.\n11\t\n12\t## Core Claims (3)\n13\t\n14\t1. **Perturbation Diagnosability** — Frozen VLA (pi0) internal activations at a single layer and single token (PaliGemma layer 6, first token) encode perturbation type with perfect accuracy (3-class K=1 F1=1.000 with first-token pooling), enabling real-time, zero-overhead perturbation diagnosis from a single forward pass.\n15\t\n16\t2. **Targeted Correction > Uniform Correction** — Perturbation-type-specific LoRA experts (Visual/Spatial/Physical), routed by the diagnosed type, outperform a universal LoRA baseline of equivalent total parameter budget on LIBERO-Plus, demonstrating that routing by perturbation type is a more efficient use of adaptation capacity than uniform correction.\n17\t\n18\t3. **Parameter-Efficient Robustness** — Meta-Brain (~12M trainable params) achieves robustness gains that a parameter-matched universal LoRA (rank 48, ~12M) cannot replicate, demonstrating that routing by perturbation type is more efficient use of adaptation capacity than uniform correction. Cross-backbone comparison with VLA-GSE (114M on Qwen3-VL-4B) is indirect/suggestive only — primary efficiency metric is within-backbone gain-over-parameter-matched-baseline.\n19\t\n20\t## Story Spine\n21\t\n22\t- **Problem**: VLAs achieve >90% on standard LIBERO but collapse under perturbation (pi0: 53.6% on LIBERO-Plus). Different perturbation types disrupt different processing stages — visual perturbations corrupt early representations, spatial perturbations invalidate action trajectories, physical perturbations break force assumptions. Yet all existing robustness methods apply either single-modality correction or perturbation-agnostic uniform adaptation.\n23\t\n24\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: VLA-GSE (114M params, 81.2% on LIBERO-Plus) demonstrates routing helps, but routes by per-token capacity needs — the same gating configuration handles camera (64.4%) and layout (82.6%) without perturbation awareness. FTM achieves 90% on visual perturbations with 4K params but cannot handle spatial/physical. RobustVLA adds +12.6% via uniform adversarial training. No method combines perturbation diagnosis with type-specific correction.\n25\t\n26\t- **Our framing**: We propose perturbation-diagnostic routing as a new design dimension for VLA robustness, orthogonal to capacity-based routing (VLA-GSE), rank-based adaptation (LoRA-SP), and task-based routing (MoIRA/CORAL). We show that VLA internals already \"know\" what went wrong — they just lack the mechanism to apply the right fix. Meta-Brain adds that mechanism with minimal parameters.\n27\t\n28\t- **Headline result template**: \"On LIBERO-Plus, Meta-Brain achieves X% with ~12M trainable parameters, improving Y% over frozen pi0 baseline and Z% over a parameter-matched rank-48 universal LoRA (~12M), demonstrating that perturbation-diagnostic routing outperforms uniform adaptation at equivalent parameter budget.\"\n29\t\n30\t## Contribution Structure (single system contribution, not 3 independent claims)\n31\t\n32\tOne well-executed systems contribution: Meta-Brain — a modular framework that diagnoses perturbation type from frozen VLA activations and routes to type-specialized LoRA experts. Supporting evidence:\n33\t1. **Empirical finding**: VLA internal representations encode perturbation type at single-layer, single-step granularity (prerequisite observation)\n34\t2. **Architecture + ablation**: PAR router + LoRA bank with comprehensive ablation ladder including parameter-matched controls (rank-48 universal), random routing baseline, and rank scaling analysis\n35\t3. **Practical insight**: Layer placement analysis reveals perturbation-type-to-layer mapping (V→early, S→mid, P→late)\n36\t\n37\tNote: Correction Memory is an optional module — present as ablation footnote, NOT as a named architectural component. Dream reviewers across all tiers viewed CM (+1-2%) as padding.\n38\t\n39\t## Venue Fit (CoRL 2026)\n40\t\n41\t**Strengths**:\n42\t- Pi0 backbone + LIBERO-Plus eval is core CoRL territory\n43\t- Architecture operates on representations (sim evaluation methodologically sufficient)\n44\t- Parameter efficiency matters for real-robot deployment (~12M vs 114M)\n45\t- Single forward pass routing = no latency overhead for real-time control\n46\t\n47\t**Risks**:\n48\t- Sim-only evaluation (mitigated: LIBERO-Plus is CVPR 2026 standard, sim-only is accepted pattern at CoRL for architecture contributions)\n49\t- Single backbone (pi0) — need gain-over-baseline framing to enable contextualized comparison with VLA-GSE (Qwen3-VL-4B)\n50\t- Absolute performance may trail SRPO (82.1%) / CorridorVLA (83.21%) which use full training — frame as parameter-efficient approach, not absolute SOTA chase\n51\t\n52\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n53\t\n54\t### C1: \"Phase 0 classification is too easy — trivially solvable routing\"\n55\t**Risk**: High Phase 0 accuracy (F1=0.993) may suggest the task is trivial and routing adds no value.\n56\t**Response**: Easy diagnosis ≠ easy correction. The value of routing is in Phase 1 (specialized vs universal LoRA), not Phase 0. Easy routing is actually desirable — it means the router adds zero overhead concern. Ablation exp-005 directly tests whether routing matters.\n57\t\n58\t### C2: \"Sim-only evaluation, no real robot\"\n59\t**Risk**: CoRL values real-world experiments.\n60\t**Response**: LIBERO-Plus is the standard robustness benchmark (CVPR 2026). Meta-Brain operates on representations, not hardware-specific signals. Sim-only is the established evaluation pattern for VLA architecture contributions at CoRL (SAFE, VLA-GSE, RobustVLA all sim-only on LIBERO variants).\n61\t\n62\t### C3: \"Single backbone (pi0), limited generalizability\"\n63\t**Risk**: Results may be specific to pi0's PaliGemma architecture.\n64\t**Response**: (a) Phase 0 finding (perturbation classifiability) is grounded in mechanistic evidence across multiple VLAs (SAFE on OpenVLA, probing on OpenVLA, feature steering on pi0.5 + OpenVLA). (b) Tier 3 cross-backbone experiment on SmolVLA/OpenVLA if time permits. (c) Gain-over-baseline metric enables fair comparison across backbones.\n65\t\n66\t### C4: \"Parameter budget comparison unfair — different backbone from VLA-GSE\"\n67\t**Risk**: Comparing 6M (on pi0) vs 114M (on Qwen3-VL-4B) is apples-to-oranges.\n68\t**Response**: Compare gain-over-respective-LoRA-baseline: VLA-GSE gains +12.0% over LoRA (69.2% → 81.2%); Meta-Brain should gain X% over universal LoRA on pi0. Parameter efficiency = gain per trainable parameter. Also report absolute numbers with caveat.\n69\t\n70\t### C5: \"3-class taxonomy may be too coarse\"\n71\t**Risk**: Lumping camera+light+background+noise into \"Visual\" may lose useful distinctions.\n72\t**Response**: Phase 0 6-class analysis shows intra-Visual perturbations are more similar to each other than to Spatial/Physical. 3-class matches the mechanistic distinction in VLA processing (early/mid/late layers). Ablation: 6-class routing vs 3-class routing comparison.\n73\t\n74\t### C6: \"Correction Memory adds complexity for marginal gain\"\n75\t**Risk**: CM may seem over-engineered for routing-weight modulation.\n76\t**Response**: CM is presented as an optional module. Ablation (with/without CM) quantifies its contribution. CM adds only 1 learned parameter (alpha) + CPU-bound FAISS.\n77\t\n78\t### C7: \"Unseen perturbation types at deployment — open-set robustness\"\n79\t**Risk**: 3-class taxonomy is fixed. Novel perturbation types (weather, sensor degradation) will be force-classified to nearest known type, potentially routing to wrong expert.\n80\t**Response**: (a) PAR outputs a probability distribution — low-confidence predictions (high entropy) can trigger fallback to universal LoRA or no correction, providing a natural open-set rejection mechanism. (b) The 3-class taxonomy covers the major perturbation axes in robotic manipulation; truly novel perturbations are an explicit limitation we acknowledge. (c) Correction Memory provides partial adaptation — retrieved exemplars from similar but not identical perturbations can modulate routing appropriately.\n81\t\n82\t### C8: \"Training-deployment feature dimension mismatch\"\n83\t**Risk**: Phase 0 classifier trained on episode-averaged activations (~44 steps) but router uses single-step (K=1) features.\n84\t**Response**: K=1 few-shot analysis directly validates this: F1=0.898 overall, layer 6 K=1=1.0. Paper must explicitly state: (a) classifier is trained on episode-averaged features for label efficiency, (b) deployed router uses single-step features, (c) K=1 validation bridges this gap. Phase 1 PAR router will be trained directly on single-step features to eliminate any residual gap.\n85\t\n86\t## Baselines & Comparisons\n87\t\n88\t| Method | Type | Params | Expected Comparison |\n89\t|--------|------|--------|-------------------|\n90\t| Frozen pi0 | Lower bound | 0 | Our improvement over this = headline number |\n91\t| Universal LoRA (rank 16) | Ablation | ~3.7M | Same per-expert capacity, no routing — tests Claim 2 |\n92\t| Meta-Brain (PAR + ALB) | Ours | ~12M | Full system (3x3.7M experts + 0.5M router) |\n93\t| Meta-Brain + CM | Ours (full) | ~12M + 1 | With Correction Memory |\n94\t| Random routing | Ensemble control | ~12M | Random expert assignment — tests if routing matters vs ensemble effect |\n95\t| Oracle routing | Upper bound | ~12M | Perfect routing — gap to Meta-Brain = routing quality |\n96\t| FTM/FLA | Visual-only | 4K-4.7M | Strong on visual, cannot do spatial/physical |\n97\t| VLA-GSE | Capacity routing | 114M | Different backbone (Qwen3-VL-4B), compare gain-over-LoRA |\n98\t| RobustVLA | Adversarial training | Full model | Uniform approach, compare robustness gain |\n99\t\n100\t## Key Figures (Planned)\n101\t\n102\t1. **Architecture diagram**: Frozen pi0 → PAR (layer 6) → soft routing → LoRA-V/S/P bank → corrected output\n103\t2. **Phase 0 evidence**: t-SNE of layer 6 activations colored by perturbation type + confusion matrix\n104\t3. **Main result table**: LIBERO-Plus per-perturbation breakdown (7 categories × methods)\n105\t4. **Ablation ladder**: Bar chart — Frozen → Universal LoRA → Random Routing → Meta-Brain → Oracle\n106\t5. **Parameter efficiency**: Scatter plot — gain-over-baseline vs trainable parameters (Meta-Brain vs VLA-GSE vs FTM vs RobustVLA)\n107\t6. **Routing analysis**: Heatmap of PAR soft routing weights per perturbation type (should be near-diagonal)\n108\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"009b5f02-a0d7-4a14-b176-7ec94b5b2bc9","uuid":"2a415e3f-adf4-4baf-9108-dbbdb0c202f6","timestamp":"2026-05-15T18:05:10.385Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515/projects/meta_brain_lora_routing/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T165902/worst/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — meta_brain_lora_routing\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: CoRL 2026 (Austin, Nov 9-12)\n- Abstract DDL: 2026-05-26\n- Paper DDL: 2026-05-29\n\n## Core Insight\n\nVLA internal representations already encode rich perturbation-type-specific information (Phase 0: single-layer F1=1.0 at K=1), yet existing robustness methods either ignore this diagnostic signal entirely (VLA-GSE, RobustVLA) or only use it for detection without correction (SAFE). Meta-Brain closes the loop: diagnose perturbation type from frozen activations, then route to a type-specialized LoRA expert for targeted correction — achieving the \"right fix for the right failure\" at ~10x fewer parameters than perturbation-agnostic capacity routing.\n\n## Core Claims (3)\n\n1. **Perturbation Diagnosability** — Frozen VLA (pi0) internal activations at a single layer and single token (PaliGemma layer 6, first token) encode perturbation type with perfect accuracy (3-class K=1 F1=1.000 with first-token pooling), enabling real-time, zero-overhead perturbation diagnosis from a single forward pass.\n\n2. **Targeted Correction > Uniform Correction** — Perturbation-type-specific LoRA experts (Visual/Spatial/Physical), routed by the diagnosed type, outperform a universal LoRA baseline of equivalent total parameter budget on LIBERO-Plus, demonstrating that routing by perturbation type is a more efficient use of adaptation capacity than uniform correction.\n\n3. **Parameter-Efficient Robustness** — Meta-Brain (~12M trainable params) achieves robustness gains that a parameter-matched universal LoRA (rank 48, ~12M) cannot replicate, demonstrating that routing by perturbation type is more efficient use of adaptation capacity than uniform correction. Cross-backbone comparison with VLA-GSE (114M on Qwen3-VL-4B) is indirect/suggestive only — primary efficiency metric is within-backbone gain-over-parameter-matched-baseline.\n\n## Story Spine\n\n- **Problem**: VLAs achieve >90% on standard LIBERO but collapse under perturbation (pi0: 53.6% on LIBERO-Plus). Different perturbation types disrupt different processing stages — visual perturbations corrupt early representations, spatial perturbations invalidate action trajectories, physical perturbations break force assumptions. Yet all existing robustness methods apply either single-modality correction or perturbation-agnostic uniform adaptation.\n\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: VLA-GSE (114M params, 81.2% on LIBERO-Plus) demonstrates routing helps, but routes by per-token capacity needs — the same gating configuration handles camera (64.4%) and layout (82.6%) without perturbation awareness. FTM achieves 90% on visual perturbations with 4K params but cannot handle spatial/physical. RobustVLA adds +12.6% via uniform adversarial training. No method combines perturbation diagnosis with type-specific correction.\n\n- **Our framing**: We propose perturbation-diagnostic routing as a new design dimension for VLA robustness, orthogonal to capacity-based routing (VLA-GSE), rank-based adaptation (LoRA-SP), and task-based routing (MoIRA/CORAL). We show that VLA internals already \"know\" what went wrong — they just lack the mechanism to apply the right fix. Meta-Brain adds that mechanism with minimal parameters.\n\n- **Headline result template**: \"On LIBERO-Plus, Meta-Brain achieves X% with ~12M trainable parameters, improving Y% over frozen pi0 baseline and Z% over a parameter-matched rank-48 universal LoRA (~12M), demonstrating that perturbation-diagnostic routing outperforms uniform adaptation at equivalent parameter budget.\"\n\n## Contribution Structure (single system contribution, not 3 independent claims)\n\nOne well-executed systems contribution: Meta-Brain — a modular framework that diagnoses perturbation type from frozen VLA activations and routes to type-specialized LoRA experts. Supporting evidence:\n1. **Empirical finding**: VLA internal representations encode perturbation type at single-layer, single-step granularity (prerequisite observation)\n2. **Architecture + ablation**: PAR router + LoRA bank with comprehensive ablation ladder including parameter-matched controls (rank-48 universal), random routing baseline, and rank scaling analysis\n3. **Practical insight**: Layer placement analysis reveals perturbation-type-to-layer mapping (V→early, S→mid, P→late)\n\nNote: Correction Memory is an optional module — present as ablation footnote, NOT as a named architectural component. Dream reviewers across all tiers viewed CM (+1-2%) as padding.\n\n## Venue Fit (CoRL 2026)\n\n**Strengths**:\n- Pi0 backbone + LIBERO-Plus eval is core CoRL territory\n- Architecture operates on representations (sim evaluation methodologically sufficient)\n- Parameter efficiency matters for real-robot deployment (~12M vs 114M)\n- Single forward pass routing = no latency overhead for real-time control\n\n**Risks**:\n- Sim-only evaluation (mitigated: LIBERO-Plus is CVPR 2026 standard, sim-only is accepted pattern at CoRL for architecture contributions)\n- Single backbone (pi0) — need gain-over-baseline framing to enable contextualized comparison with VLA-GSE (Qwen3-VL-4B)\n- Absolute performance may trail SRPO (82.1%) / CorridorVLA (83.21%) which use full training — frame as parameter-efficient approach, not absolute SOTA chase\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n### C1: \"Phase 0 classification is too easy — trivially solvable routing\"\n**Risk**: High Phase 0 accuracy (F1=0.993) may suggest the task is trivial and routing adds no value.\n**Response**: Easy diagnosis ≠ easy correction. The value of routing is in Phase 1 (specialized vs universal LoRA), not Phase 0. Easy routing is actually desirable — it means the router adds zero overhead concern. Ablation exp-005 directly tests whether routing matters.\n\n### C2: \"Sim-only evaluation, no real robot\"\n**Risk**: CoRL values real-world experiments.\n**Response**: LIBERO-Plus is the standard robustness benchmark (CVPR 2026). Meta-Brain operates on representations, not hardware-specific signals. Sim-only is the established evaluation pattern for VLA architecture contributions at CoRL (SAFE, VLA-GSE, RobustVLA all sim-only on LIBERO variants).\n\n### C3: \"Single backbone (pi0), limited generalizability\"\n**Risk**: Results may be specific to pi0's PaliGemma architecture.\n**Response**: (a) Phase 0 finding (perturbation classifiability) is grounded in mechanistic evidence across multiple VLAs (SAFE on OpenVLA, probing on OpenVLA, feature steering on pi0.5 + OpenVLA). (b) Tier 3 cross-backbone experiment on SmolVLA/OpenVLA if time permits. (c) Gain-over-baseline metric enables fair comparison across backbones.\n\n### C4: \"Parameter budget comparison unfair — different backbone from VLA-GSE\"\n**Risk**: Comparing 6M (on pi0) vs 114M (on Qwen3-VL-4B) is apples-to-oranges.\n**Response**: Compare gain-over-respective-LoRA-baseline: VLA-GSE gains +12.0% over LoRA (69.2% → 81.2%); Meta-Brain should gain X% over universal LoRA on pi0. Parameter efficiency = gain per trainable parameter. Also report absolute numbers with caveat.\n\n### C5: \"3-class taxonomy may be too coarse\"\n**Risk**: Lumping camera+light+background+noise into \"Visual\" may lose useful distinctions.\n**Response**: Phase 0 6-class analysis shows intra-Visual perturbations are more similar to each other than to Spatial/Physical. 3-class matches the mechanistic distinction in VLA processing (early/mid/late layers). Ablation: 6-class routing vs 3-class routing comparison.\n\n### C6: \"Correction Memory adds complexity for marginal gain\"\n**Risk**: CM may seem over-engineered for routing-weight modulation.\n**Response**: CM is presented as an optional module. Ablation (with/without CM) quantifies its contribution. CM adds only 1 learned parameter (alpha) + CPU-bound FAISS.\n\n### C7: \"Unseen perturbation types at deployment — open-set robustness\"\n**Risk**: 3-class taxonomy is fixed. Novel perturbation types (weather, sensor degradation) will be force-classified to nearest known type, potentially routing to wrong expert.\n**Response**: (a) PAR outputs a probability distribution — low-confidence predictions (high entropy) can trigger fallback to universal LoRA or no correction, providing a natural open-set rejection mechanism. (b) The 3-class taxonomy covers the major perturbation axes in robotic manipulation; truly novel perturbations are an explicit limitation we acknowledge. (c) Correction Memory provides partial adaptation — retrieved exemplars from similar but not identical perturbations can modulate routing appropriately.\n\n### C8: \"Training-deployment feature dimension mismatch\"\n**Risk**: Phase 0 classifier trained on episode-averaged activations (~44 steps) but router uses single-step (K=1) features.\n**Response**: K=1 few-shot analysis directly validates this: F1=0.898 overall, layer 6 K=1=1.0. Paper must explicitly state: (a) classifier is trained on episode-averaged features for label efficiency, (b) deployed router uses single-step features, (c) K=1 validation bridges this gap. Phase 1 PAR router will be trained directly on single-step features to eliminate any residual gap.\n\n## Baselines & Comparisons\n\n| Method | Type | Params | Expected Comparison |\n|--------|------|--------|-------------------|\n| Frozen pi0 | Lower bound | 0 | Our improvement over this = headline number |\n| Universal LoRA (rank 16) | Ablation | ~3.7M | Same per-expert capacity, no routing — tests Claim 2 |\n| Meta-Brain (PAR + ALB) | Ours | ~12M | Full system (3x3.7M experts + 0.5M router) |\n| Meta-Brain + CM | Ours (full) | ~12M + 1 | With Correction Memory |\n| Random routing | Ensemble control | ~12M | Random expert assignment — tests if routing matters vs ensemble effect |\n| Oracle routing | Upper bound | ~12M | Perfect routing — gap to Meta-Brain = routing quality |\n| FTM/FLA | Visual-only | 4K-4.7M | Strong on visual, cannot do spatial/physical |\n| VLA-GSE | Capacity routing | 114M | Different backbone (Qwen3-VL-4B), compare gain-over-LoRA |\n| RobustVLA | Adversarial training | Full model | Uniform approach, compare robustness gain |\n\n## Key Figures (Planned)\n\n1. **Architecture diagram**: Frozen pi0 → PAR (layer 6) → soft routing → LoRA-V/S/P bank → corrected output\n2. **Phase 0 evidence**: t-SNE of layer 6 activations colored by perturbation type + confusion matrix\n3. **Main result table**: LIBERO-Plus per-perturbation breakdown (7 categories × methods)\n4. **Ablation ladder**: Bar chart — Frozen → Universal LoRA → Random Routing → Meta-Brain → Oracle\n5. **Parameter efficiency**: Scatter plot — gain-over-baseline vs trainable parameters (Meta-Brain vs VLA-GSE vs FTM vs RobustVLA)\n6. **Routing analysis**: Heatmap of PAR soft routing weights per perturbation type (should be near-diagonal)\n","numLines":108,"startLine":1,"totalLines":108}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RQEP1xH6urNGWgm6zwdCmt","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"LoRA expert training — 3 perturbation-specific + 1 universal baseline\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Train 4 LoRA adapters (rank 16, ~3.7M each) on frozen pi0 PaliGemma attention layers. LoRA-V on visual augmented data, LoRA-S on spatial perturbation rollouts, LoRA-P on physical perturbation rollouts, Universal on mixed data. Evaluate each on own type and cross-type.\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"lora_v_on_visual\": 67.0,\n7\t      \"lora_v_on_spatial\": 58.0,\n8\t      \"lora_v_on_physical\": 49.5,\n9\t      \"lora_s_on_visual\": 62.5,\n10\t      \"lora_s_on_spatial\": 62.0,\n11\t      \"lora_s_on_physical\": 50.0,\n12\t      \"lora_p_on_visual\": 61.0,\n13\t      \"lora_p_on_spatial\": 57.5,\n14\t      \"lora_p_on_physical\": 55.5,\n15\t      \"universal_r16_on_visual\": 61.5,\n16\t      \"universal_r16_on_spatial\": 56.0,\n17\t      \"universal_r16_on_physical\": 49.0,\n18\t      \"universal_r16_overall\": 58.5,\n19\t      \"cross_type_avg_drop_pp\": 4.7,\n20\t      \"lora_v_training_loss_final\": 0.018,\n21\t      \"lora_s_training_loss_final\": 0.022,\n22\t      \"lora_p_training_loss_final\": 0.031,\n23\t      \"convergence_epochs_v\": 12,\n24\t      \"convergence_epochs_s\": 18,\n25\t      \"convergence_epochs_p\": 25\n26\t    },\n27\t    \"tables\": [\n28\t      {\n29\t        \"name\": \"Expert × Perturbation Type Cross-Evaluation Matrix (Success Rate %)\",\n30\t        \"rows\": [\n31\t          [\n32\t            \"Method\",\n33\t            \"Visual\",\n34\t            \"Spatial\",\n35\t            \"Physical\",\n36\t            \"Overall\"\n37\t          ],\n38\t          [\n39\t            \"LoRA-V (rank 16)\",\n40\t            \"67.0 ± 2.1\",\n41\t            \"58.0 ± 2.8\",\n42\t            \"49.5 ± 3.2\",\n43\t            \"60.8 ± 1.9\"\n44\t          ],\n45\t          [\n46\t            \"LoRA-S (rank 16)\",\n47\t            \"62.5 ± 2.4\",\n48\t            \"62.0 ± 2.6\",\n49\t            \"50.0 ± 3.0\",\n50\t            \"59.7 ± 1.8\"\n51\t          ],\n52\t          [\n53\t            \"LoRA-P (rank 16)\",\n54\t            \"61.0 ± 2.5\",\n55\t            \"57.5 ± 2.9\",\n56\t            \"55.5 ± 3.1\",\n57\t            \"59.2 ± 2.0\"\n58\t          ],\n59\t          [\n60\t            \"Universal (rank 16)\",\n61\t            \"61.5 ± 2.3\",\n62\t            \"56.0 ± 2.7\",\n63\t            \"49.0 ± 3.3\",\n64\t            \"58.5 ± 1.7\"\n65\t          ],\n66\t          [\n67\t            \"Frozen pi0\",\n68\t            \"51.2 ± 1.8\",\n69\t            \"57.4 ± 2.5\",\n70\t            \"54.8 ± 2.9\",\n71\t            \"53.6 ± 1.5\"\n72\t          ]\n73\t        ]\n74\t      },\n75\t      {\n76\t        \"name\": \"Cross-Type Mismatch Drop (pp)\",\n77\t        \"rows\": [\n78\t          [\n79\t            \"Perturbation Type\",\n80\t            \"Matched Expert\",\n81\t            \"Best Mismatched\",\n82\t            \"Drop (pp)\"\n83\t          ],\n84\t          [\n85\t            \"Visual\",\n86\t            \"LoRA-V: 67.0\",\n87\t            \"LoRA-S: 62.5\",\n88\t            \"4.5\"\n89\t          ],\n90\t          [\n91\t            \"Spatial\",\n92\t            \"LoRA-S: 62.0\",\n93\t            \"LoRA-V: 58.0\",\n94\t            \"4.0\"\n95\t          ],\n96\t          [\n97\t            \"Physical\",\n98\t            \"LoRA-P: 55.5\",\n99\t            \"LoRA-S: 50.0\",\n100\t            \"5.5\"\n101\t          ]\n102\t        ]\n103\t      }\n104\t    ],\n105\t    \"figures\": [],\n106\t    \"analysis\": \"worst 档的核心证据出现：cross-type drop 平均仅 4.7pp，远低于证明类型特异性路由价值 所需的 >10pp 阈值。LoRA-S 在 Visual 上达 62.5%（仅比 LoRA-V 低 4.5pp）是致命的—— 这意味着一个为空间扰动训练的适配器几乎可以胜任视觉扰动修正。Physical 类型的绝对性能 低（最高仅 55.5%）表明 rank 16 LoRA 根本无法有效修正物理扰动。注意 Universal r16 的 58.5% 并不差——它在各类型上接近中位数表现，证实 \\\"混合训练 + 更多参数\\\" 可能优于 \\\"专家路由\\\"。\\n\\n\\n在 worst 档下，专家之间的交叉类型性能下降很小（平均 ~4.7pp），核心原因是 LoRA rank 16 的容量不足以学到真正类型特异性的修正模式。各专家在自身类型上的优势主要来自训练数据分布 匹配，而非学到了质性不同的修正函数。LoRA-V 在 Visual 上最强（67%）是因为视觉增强的 训练范式（FTM 式）天然适配 LoRA 微调，但当 LoRA-S 被错误应用于 Visual 时仍达 62.5% （仅降 4.5pp），说明 LoRA-S 学到的修正在空间上和视觉修正高度重叠。Physical 类型整体 最弱（LoRA-P 仅 55.5%），因为物理扰动改变了力学和接触动态，需要更深层的动作策略调整， 而不仅是表征修正。Universal LoRA r16 的整体 58.5% 已经接近各专家在自身类型上的平均水平， 进一步证实容量而非路由是主要瓶颈。\\n\"\n107\t  },\n108\t  {\n109\t    \"name\": \"Meta-Brain assembly — PAR router + LoRA bank end-to-end\",\n110\t    \"description\": \"Assemble PAR router (PaliGemma layer 6, 2-layer MLP) + 3 LoRA experts with soft routing. End-to-end routing fine-tuning with frozen LoRA parameters. Evaluate on full LIBERO-Plus.\\n\",\n111\t    \"results\": {\n112\t      \"libero_plus_overall\": 64.0,\n113\t      \"visual_overall\": 67.0,\n114\t      \"visual_camera\": 69.5,\n115\t      \"visual_light\": 71.0,\n116\t      \"visual_background\": 64.0,\n117\t      \"visual_noise\": 63.5,\n118\t      \"spatial_layout\": 61.5,\n119\t      \"physical_robot\": 54.0,\n120\t      \"routing_weight_visual_to_lora_v\": 0.58,\n121\t      \"routing_weight_visual_to_lora_s\": 0.24,\n122\t      \"routing_weight_visual_to_lora_p\": 0.18,\n123\t      \"routing_weight_spatial_to_lora_s\": 0.52,\n124\t      \"routing_weight_spatial_to_lora_v\": 0.28,\n125\t      \"routing_weight_spatial_to_lora_p\": 0.2,\n126\t      \"routing_weight_physical_to_lora_p\": 0.48,\n127\t      \"routing_weight_physical_to_lora_v\": 0.22,\n128\t      \"routing_weight_physical_to_lora_s\": 0.3,\n129\t      \"par_router_online_accuracy\": 97.8,\n130\t      \"routing_entropy_visual\": 1.32,\n131\t      \"routing_entropy_spatial\": 1.41,\n132\t      \"routing_entropy_physical\": 1.48\n133\t    },\n134\t    \"tables\": [\n135\t      {\n136\t        \"name\": \"Meta-Brain LIBERO-Plus Per-Perturbation Breakdown\",\n137\t        \"rows\": [\n138\t          [\n139\t            \"Perturbation\",\n140\t            \"Type\",\n141\t            \"Meta-Brain (%)\",\n142\t            \"Frozen pi0 (%)\",\n143\t            \"Δ (pp)\"\n144\t          ],\n145\t          [\n146\t            \"camera\",\n147\t            \"Visual\",\n148\t            \"69.5 ± 2.4\",\n149\t            \"49.0 ± 2.0\",\n150\t            \"+20.5\"\n151\t          ],\n152\t          [\n153\t            \"light\",\n154\t            \"Visual\",\n155\t            \"71.0 ± 2.2\",\n156\t            \"55.2 ± 1.9\",\n157\t            \"+15.8\"\n158\t          ],\n159\t          [\n160\t            \"background\",\n161\t            \"Visual\",\n162\t            \"64.0 ± 2.6\",\n163\t            \"57.0 ± 2.2\",\n164\t            \"+7.0\"\n165\t          ],\n166\t          [\n167\t            \"noise\",\n168\t            \"Visual\",\n169\t            \"63.5 ± 2.7\",\n170\t            \"47.6 ± 2.1\",\n171\t            \"+15.9\"\n172\t          ],\n173\t          [\n174\t            \"layout\",\n175\t            \"Spatial\",\n176\t            \"61.5 ± 2.8\",\n177\t            \"57.4 ± 2.5\",\n178\t            \"+4.1\"\n179\t          ],\n180\t          [\n181\t            \"robot\",\n182\t            \"Physical\",\n183\t            \"54.0 ± 3.2\",\n184\t            \"54.8 ± 2.9\",\n185\t            \"-0.8\"\n186\t          ],\n187\t          [\n188\t            \"Overall\",\n189\t            \"—\",\n190\t            \"64.0 ± 1.6\",\n191\t            \"53.6 ± 1.5\",\n192\t            \"+10.4\"\n193\t          ]\n194\t        ]\n195\t      },\n196\t      {\n197\t        \"name\": \"PAR Soft Routing Weight Matrix\",\n198\t        \"rows\": [\n199\t          [\n200\t            \"True Type\",\n201\t            \"→ LoRA-V\",\n202\t            \"→ LoRA-S\",\n203\t            \"→ LoRA-P\",\n204\t            \"Entropy\"\n205\t          ],\n206\t          [\n207\t            \"Visual\",\n208\t            \"0.58\",\n209\t            \"0.24\",\n210\t            \"0.18\",\n211\t            \"1.32\"\n212\t          ],\n213\t          [\n214\t            \"Spatial\",\n215\t            \"0.28\",\n216\t            \"0.52\",\n217\t            \"0.20\",\n218\t            \"1.41\"\n219\t          ],\n220\t          [\n221\t            \"Physical\",\n222\t            \"0.22\",\n223\t            \"0.30\",\n224\t            \"0.48\",\n225\t            \"1.48\"\n226\t          ]\n227\t        ]\n228\t      }\n229\t    ],\n230\t    \"figures\": [],\n231\t    \"analysis\": \"Meta-Brain 的整体表现（64.0%）看似合理，但关键问题在路由行为。PAR router 的 online classification accuracy 仍高达 97.8%（与 Phase 0 一致），但 end-to-end fine-tuning 后路由权重没有收敛到 one-hot。这意味着系统\\\"发现\\\"混合使用专家比严格路由更有效—— 这是 Claim 2 崩塌的直接信号。Physical 类型的 -0.8pp（比 frozen 还低）尤其致命： 路由不仅没帮助，反而因为将部分权重分配给不相关的专家而引入了干扰。\\n\\n\\n整体 64.0% 在 worst 范围 [58, 68] 内。路由权重分布是最关键的诊断信号：soft routing 没有收敛到接近 one-hot 的分配（理想情况下对角线应 >0.85），而是呈现分散的权重分布。 Visual 类型最好的情况也仅将 58% 的权重分配给 LoRA-V，剩余 42% 分散给 S 和 P。 Physical 类型甚至只有 48% 分配给 LoRA-P，30% 给了 LoRA-S。这直接证实了 end-to-end fine-tuning 发现 \\\"混合使用多个专家\\\" 比 \\\"路由到正确专家\\\" 更有效——系统退化为了隐式的 软集成（soft ensemble），而非真正的类型特异性路由。路由熵在 1.3-1.5 之间（最大熵 log(3)=1.58），接近均匀分布。Physical 类型的低绝对性能（54.0%，仅比 frozen +0.8pp 的 delta 中 Physical 类型贡献最小）再次确认物理扰动修正是瓶颈。\\n\"\n232\t  },\n233\t  {\n234\t    \"name\": \"Oracle routing ablation — upper bound for routing quality\",\n235\t    \"description\": \"Replace PAR router with ground-truth perturbation type labels (hard one-hot routing). Measures ceiling for routing quality.\\n\",\n236\t    \"results\": {\n237\t      \"oracle_overall\": 69.9,\n238\t      \"oracle_visual\": 73.0,\n239\t      \"oracle_spatial\": 68.0,\n240\t      \"oracle_physical\": 59.5,\n241\t      \"oracle_minus_meta_brain_overall\": 5.9,\n242\t      \"oracle_minus_meta_brain_visual\": 6.0,\n243\t      \"oracle_minus_meta_brain_spatial\": 6.5,\n244\t      \"oracle_minus_meta_brain_physical\": 5.5,\n245\t      \"oracle_minus_frozen\": 16.3\n246\t    },\n247\t    \"tables\": [\n248\t      {\n249\t        \"name\": \"Oracle vs PAR Routing Comparison\",\n250\t        \"rows\": [\n251\t          [\n252\t            \"Method\",\n253\t            \"Visual\",\n254\t            \"Spatial\",\n255\t            \"Physical\",\n256\t            \"Overall\"\n257\t          ],\n258\t          [\n259\t            \"Oracle routing\",\n260\t            \"73.0 ± 1.8\",\n261\t            \"68.0 ± 2.3\",\n262\t            \"59.5 ± 2.7\",\n263\t            \"69.9 ± 1.4\"\n264\t          ],\n265\t          [\n266\t            \"Meta-Brain (PAR)\",\n267\t            \"67.0 ± 2.1\",\n268\t            \"61.5 ± 2.8\",\n269\t            \"54.0 ± 3.2\",\n270\t            \"64.0 ± 1.6\"\n271\t          ],\n272\t          [\n273\t            \"Gap (pp)\",\n274\t            \"+6.0\",\n275\t            \"+6.5\",\n276\t            \"+5.5\",\n277\t            \"+5.9\"\n278\t          ]\n279\t        ]\n280\t      }\n281\t    ],\n282\t    \"figures\": [],\n283\t    \"analysis\": \"5.9pp 的 oracle gap 在 worst 范围 [5, 12] 的低端，但仍然显著。关键洞察：oracle 的 优势不等于 \\\"PAR router 不够准\\\"（PAR accuracy >97%），而是 hard routing vs soft routing 的结构性差异。这为 \\\"open problem\\\" 叙事提供了素材：如果能训练出更 specialized 的专家， routing 的价值可以释放。但在当前实验设定下，这只是一个未兑现的 promise。\\n\\n\\nOracle routing（69.9%）显著高于 Meta-Brain（64.0%），gap 达 5.9pp。这一结果的解释 是双面的：(1) 它证明了路由\\\"原则上\\\"有价值——完美路由比 Meta-Brain 的 soft-ensemble 好 6pp；(2) 但它同时证明当前专家不够 specialized——即使完美路由，oracle 也只比 rank-48 universal（63.3%）高 6.6pp。对比理想情况：如果专家真的学到了完全不同的修正模式， oracle 应该接近各专家在自身类型上的最佳表现的加权平均（~64.5%），但 oracle 的 69.9% 远高于此。这说明 one-hot hard routing 的优势不在于\\\"选对专家\\\"，而在于避免了 soft routing 带来的专家间干扰——当错误专家的权重为零时，修正信号更纯净。Physical 类型的 oracle（59.5%）仍然偏低，进一步确认 LoRA-P 的能力上限受限于 rank 16 容量。\\n\"\n284\t  },\n285\t  {\n286\t    \"name\": \"Ablation ladder — Frozen → Universal LoRA → Random → Meta-Brain → Oracle\",\n287\t    \"description\": \"Systematic comparison on LIBERO-Plus with 5 seeds. Core evidence for Claim 2. Includes rank-48 parameter-matched control from plan_013.\\n\",\n288\t    \"results\": {\n289\t      \"frozen_pi0_overall\": 53.6,\n290\t      \"universal_r16_overall\": 58.5,\n291\t      \"universal_r48_overall\": 63.3,\n292\t      \"random_routing_overall\": 62.4,\n293\t      \"meta_brain_overall\": 64.0,\n294\t      \"meta_brain_plus_cm_overall\": 64.7,\n295\t      \"oracle_routing_overall\": 69.9,\n296\t      \"meta_brain_vs_frozen_gain\": 10.4,\n297\t      \"meta_brain_vs_r48_gap\": 0.7,\n298\t      \"meta_brain_vs_random_gap\": 1.6,\n299\t      \"meta_brain_vs_r48_p_value\": 0.42,\n300\t      \"meta_brain_vs_random_p_value\": 0.18,\n301\t      \"oracle_vs_meta_brain_gap\": 5.9,\n302\t      \"seeds_std_frozen\": 1.5,\n303\t      \"seeds_std_r16\": 1.7,\n304\t      \"seeds_std_r48\": 1.9,\n305\t      \"seeds_std_random\": 2.2,\n306\t      \"seeds_std_meta_brain\": 1.6,\n307\t      \"seeds_std_oracle\": 1.4\n308\t    },\n309\t    \"tables\": [\n310\t      {\n311\t        \"name\": \"Complete Ablation Ladder (LIBERO-Plus, 5 seeds)\",\n312\t        \"rows\": [\n313\t          [\n314\t            \"Method\",\n315\t            \"Params\",\n316\t            \"Overall (%)\",\n317\t            \"Visual\",\n318\t            \"Spatial\",\n319\t            \"Physical\",\n320\t            \"Δ vs Frozen\"\n321\t          ],\n322\t          [\n323\t            \"Frozen pi0\",\n324\t            \"0\",\n325\t            \"53.6 ± 1.5\",\n326\t            \"51.2\",\n327\t            \"57.4\",\n328\t            \"54.8\",\n329\t            \"—\"\n330\t          ],\n331\t          [\n332\t            \"Universal r16\",\n333\t            \"3.7M\",\n334\t            \"58.5 ± 1.7\",\n335\t            \"61.5\",\n336\t            \"56.0\",\n337\t            \"49.0\",\n338\t            \"+4.9\"\n339\t          ],\n340\t          [\n341\t            \"Universal r48\",\n342\t            \"12.0M\",\n343\t            \"63.3 ± 1.9\",\n344\t            \"66.5\",\n345\t            \"61.0\",\n346\t            \"53.0\",\n347\t            \"+9.7\"\n348\t          ],\n349\t          [\n350\t            \"Random routing\",\n351\t            \"11.6M\",\n352\t            \"62.4 ± 2.2\",\n353\t            \"65.5\",\n354\t            \"60.0\",\n355\t            \"52.5\",\n356\t            \"+8.8\"\n357\t          ],\n358\t          [\n359\t            \"Meta-Brain (PAR)\",\n360\t            \"12.1M\",\n361\t            \"64.0 ± 1.6\",\n362\t            \"67.0\",\n363\t            \"61.5\",\n364\t            \"54.0\",\n365\t            \"+10.4\"\n366\t          ],\n367\t          [\n368\t            \"Meta-Brain + CM\",\n369\t            \"12.1M+\",\n370\t            \"64.7 ± 1.7\",\n371\t            \"67.6\",\n372\t            \"62.0\",\n373\t            \"54.6\",\n374\t            \"+11.1\"\n375\t          ],\n376\t          [\n377\t            \"Oracle routing\",\n378\t            \"11.6M\",\n379\t            \"69.9 ± 1.4\",\n380\t            \"73.0\",\n381\t            \"68.0\",\n382\t            \"59.5\",\n383\t            \"+16.3\"\n384\t          ]\n385\t        ]\n386\t      },\n387\t      {\n388\t        \"name\": \"Statistical Significance Tests (paired t-test, 5 seeds)\",\n389\t        \"rows\": [\n390\t          [\n391\t            \"Comparison\",\n392\t            \"Δ (pp)\",\n393\t            \"t-statistic\",\n394\t            \"p-value\",\n395\t            \"Significant?\"\n396\t          ],\n397\t          [\n398\t            \"Meta-Brain vs Frozen\",\n399\t            \"+10.4\",\n400\t            \"8.12\",\n401\t            \"0.001\",\n402\t            \"Yes\"\n403\t          ],\n404\t          [\n405\t            \"Meta-Brain vs Universal r16\",\n406\t            \"+5.5\",\n407\t            \"4.31\",\n408\t            \"0.013\",\n409\t            \"Yes\"\n410\t          ],\n411\t          [\n412\t            \"Meta-Brain vs Universal r48\",\n413\t            \"+0.7\",\n414\t            \"0.88\",\n415\t            \"0.42\",\n416\t            \"No\"\n417\t          ],\n418\t          [\n419\t            \"Meta-Brain vs Random\",\n420\t            \"+1.6\",\n421\t            \"1.56\",\n422\t            \"0.18\",\n423\t            \"No\"\n424\t          ],\n425\t          [\n426\t            \"Oracle vs Meta-Brain\",\n427\t            \"+5.9\",\n428\t            \"5.87\",\n429\t            \"0.004\",\n430\t            \"Yes\"\n431\t          ],\n432\t          [\n433\t            \"Random vs Universal r16\",\n434\t            \"+3.9\",\n435\t            \"3.02\",\n436\t            \"0.039\",\n437\t            \"Yes\"\n438\t          ]\n439\t        ]\n440\t      }\n441\t    ],\n442\t    \"figures\": [],\n443\t    \"analysis\": \"Ablation ladder 的数据模式彻底否定了 Claim 2。三个关键观察：(1) Rank-48 universal （63.3%）几乎等于 Meta-Brain（64.0%），gap=0.7pp 不显著（p=0.42）——参数缩放完全 替代了路由；(2) Random routing（62.4%）接近 Meta-Brain（gap=1.6pp, p=0.18）——集成 效应解释了大部分多专家收益；(3) Oracle（69.9%）显著高于 Meta-Brain（gap=5.9pp, p=0.004）——理论上路由有价值，但当前专家训练无法实现。有趣的是 Random > r16（+3.9pp, p=0.039），说明 3×rank-16 的参数量加上多样性确实比 1×rank-16 好，但这是参数+集成 效应，与路由无关。\\n\\n\\n这是 worst 档的核心毁灭性实验。Meta-Brain（64.0%）仅比 rank-48 universal（63.3%） 高 0.7pp，p=0.42——统计上完全不显著。Meta-Brain 比 random routing（62.4%）高 1.6pp， p=0.18——仍不显著（需 <0.05）。这意味着：(1) 路由对比容量缩放无优势——多花在路由器 上的参数不如直接增加 LoRA rank；(2) 随机分配专家（纯集成效应）已经捕获了多专家结构 的大部分收益。Random routing 的 62.4% 表明 3 个 rank-16 LoRA 的\\\"多样性集成\\\"本身 就比单个 rank-16 好 4pp，但这是集成效应而非路由效应。5 seeds 下的标准差在 1.4-2.2pp 范围，meta_brain_vs_r48 的 0.7pp gap 完全落在噪声范围内。Claim 2 在统计意义上被 判定为 NOT SUPPORTED。\\n\"\n444\t  },\n445\t  {\n446\t    \"name\": \"Rank-48 parameter-matched universal LoRA — existential control\",\n447\t    \"description\": \"Train single universal LoRA with rank 48 (~12M params) matching Meta-Brain's total parameter budget. The #1 critical experiment: if r48 ≈ Meta-Brain, Claim 2 collapses.\\n\",\n448\t    \"results\": {\n449\t      \"rank48_universal_overall\": 63.3,\n450\t      \"rank48_visual\": 66.5,\n451\t      \"rank48_spatial\": 61.0,\n452\t      \"rank48_physical\": 53.0,\n453\t      \"rank48_vs_meta_brain_gap\": -0.7,\n454\t      \"rank48_vs_r16_gain\": 4.8,\n455\t      \"rank48_training_loss_final\": 0.015,\n456\t      \"rank48_convergence_epoch\": 15,\n457\t      \"claim2_survival\": false\n458\t    },\n459\t    \"tables\": [\n460\t      {\n461\t        \"name\": \"Parameter-Matched Comparison: Universal r48 vs Meta-Brain\",\n462\t        \"rows\": [\n463\t          [\n464\t            \"Metric\",\n465\t            \"Universal r48\",\n466\t            \"Meta-Brain\",\n467\t            \"Δ\"\n468\t          ],\n469\t          [\n470\t            \"Params (trainable)\",\n471\t            \"12.0M\",\n472\t            \"12.1M\",\n473\t            \"—\"\n474\t          ],\n475\t          [\n476\t            \"Overall (%)\",\n477\t            \"63.3 ± 1.9\",\n478\t            \"64.0 ± 1.6\",\n479\t            \"+0.7\"\n480\t          ],\n481\t          [\n482\t            \"Visual (%)\",\n483\t            \"66.5\",\n484\t            \"67.0\",\n485\t            \"+0.5\"\n486\t          ],\n487\t          [\n488\t            \"Spatial (%)\",\n489\t            \"61.0\",\n490\t            \"61.5\",\n491\t            \"+0.5\"\n492\t          ],\n493\t          [\n494\t            \"Physical (%)\",\n495\t            \"53.0\",\n496\t            \"54.0\",\n497\t            \"+1.0\"\n498\t          ],\n499\t          [\n500\t            \"Architecture complexity\",\n501\t            \"Single LoRA\",\n502\t            \"Router + 3 LoRA + merge\",\n503\t            \"—\"\n504\t          ],\n505\t          [\n506\t            \"Inference overhead\",\n507\t            \"None\",\n508\t            \"Router forward pass\",\n509\t            \"—\"\n510\t          ]\n511\t        ]\n512\t      }\n513\t    ],\n514\t    \"figures\": [],\n515\t    \"analysis\": \"这是 worst 档最致命的单一实验结果。r48 universal 证明了一个简单的推论：如果你有 12M 参数预算，把它们全部给一个 LoRA 和把它们分成 3 份再加路由器效果一样。路由的额外架构 复杂度（router 训练、soft-merge 计算、在线分类）变成了纯粹的工程开销而非性能收益。 在 reframing 叙事中，这一结果应被诚实报告并解读为\\\"路由的价值需要更 specialized 的 专家来解锁\\\"——指向 oracle gap 作为 open problem。\\n\\n\\nRank-48 universal 达到 63.3%，仅比 Meta-Brain 低 0.7pp——Claim 2 的 existential control 判定为 FAIL。原因：当 LoRA rank 从 16 提升到 48 时，单一适配器获得了足够的 表征容量来同时处理所有扰动类型。Rank 16 的\\\"容量瓶颈\\\"迫使 universal LoRA 做 trade-off （Visual 好但 Physical 差），但 rank 48 消除了这个 trade-off。在 Visual 上 rank-48 （66.5%）已经接近 LoRA-V 专家（67.0%），说明额外的 rank 足以学到视觉修正所需的所有 模式，无需专门训练。Physical 上 rank-48（53.0%）略低于 LoRA-P（55.5%），但差距可忽略。 这证明参数预算等效时，将 12M 参数分配给一个 rank-48 适配器与分配给 3 个 rank-16 专家加一个路由器效果相同——路由的工程复杂度没有带来性能回报。\\n\"\n516\t  },\n517\t  {\n518\t    \"name\": \"FTM/FLA reproduction — visual-only baseline comparison\",\n519\t    \"description\": \"Reproduce FTM on pi0 for visual perturbation types. Compare Meta-Brain LoRA-V vs FTM.\\n\",\n520\t    \"results\": {\n521\t      \"ftm_on_visual_overall\": 71.2,\n522\t      \"ftm_on_camera\": 74.0,\n523\t      \"ftm_on_light\": 75.5,\n524\t      \"ftm_on_background\": 68.0,\n525\t      \"ftm_on_noise\": 67.3,\n526\t      \"ftm_params\": 4096,\n527\t      \"lora_v_on_visual_overall\": 67.0,\n528\t      \"meta_brain_on_visual_overall\": 67.0,\n529\t      \"ftm_vs_lora_v_gap\": 4.2,\n530\t      \"ftm_on_spatial\": 55.0,\n531\t      \"ftm_on_physical\": 52.0,\n532\t      \"meta_brain_advantage_on_non_visual\": 7.8\n533\t    },\n534\t    \"tables\": [\n535\t      {\n536\t        \"name\": \"FTM vs Meta-Brain Comparison\",\n537\t        \"rows\": [\n538\t          [\n539\t            \"Method\",\n540\t            \"Params\",\n541\t            \"Visual\",\n542\t            \"Spatial\",\n543\t            \"Physical\",\n544\t            \"Overall\"\n545\t          ],\n546\t          [\n547\t            \"FTM (reproduced)\",\n548\t            \"4K\",\n549\t            \"71.2\",\n550\t            \"55.0\",\n551\t            \"52.0\",\n552\t            \"62.8\"\n553\t          ],\n554\t          [\n555\t            \"Meta-Brain\",\n556\t            \"12.1M\",\n557\t            \"67.0\",\n558\t            \"61.5\",\n559\t            \"54.0\",\n560\t            \"64.0\"\n561\t          ],\n562\t          [\n563\t            \"LoRA-V only\",\n564\t            \"3.7M\",\n565\t            \"67.0\",\n566\t            \"58.0\",\n567\t            \"49.5\",\n568\t            \"60.8\"\n569\t          ]\n570\t        ]\n571\t      }\n572\t    ],\n573\t    \"figures\": [],\n574\t    \"analysis\": \"FTM 的强势表现为 reframed paper 提供了有用的参照：Meta-Brain 的路由设计初衷是\\\"比 FTM 更全面\\\"，但在 worst 档下，它在 FTM 的强项（视觉）上弱于 FTM，在自己的差异化 方向（spatial/physical）上又只比 frozen 提升几个点。reframing 策略应避免与 FTM 直接比较参数效率，而聚焦于 Phase 0 的诊断能力——FTM 不知道自己在修正什么类型的 扰动，Meta-Brain 知道但未能有效利用这一知识。\\n\\n\\nFTM 在视觉扰动上达到 71.2%，显著优于 Meta-Brain 的 67.0%（gap=4.2pp），且仅用 4K 参数（vs Meta-Brain 12M）。原因：FTM 的 fine-tuning + masking 策略专门针对视觉通道 优化，是一个更 \\\"tight\\\" 的视觉修正工具；而 Meta-Brain 的 LoRA-V 是通用 LoRA 架构， 在视觉修正上不如定制方法高效。Meta-Brain 的优势理论上在非视觉类型：Meta-Brain spatial=61.5, physical=54.0 vs FTM spatial=55.0, physical=52.0，但这一 \\\"全面性\\\" 优势在 worst 档下被 rank-48 universal 的等效表现所消解——为什么要用一个复杂路由系统 来获得\\\"全面但每项都不如专门方法\\\"的结果？\\n\"\n575\t  },\n576\t  {\n577\t    \"name\": \"Parameter efficiency analysis — gain-over-baseline vs trainable params\",\n578\t    \"description\": \"Compute gain-over-frozen-baseline per method, normalize by trainable parameters. Generate parameter efficiency scatter plot.\\n\",\n579\t    \"results\": {\n580\t      \"meta_brain_gain_over_frozen\": 10.4,\n581\t      \"meta_brain_gain_per_million_params\": 0.86,\n582\t      \"universal_r48_gain_over_frozen\": 9.7,\n583\t      \"universal_r48_gain_per_million_params\": 0.81,\n584\t      \"universal_r16_gain_over_frozen\": 4.9,\n585\t      \"universal_r16_gain_per_million_params\": 1.32,\n586\t      \"ftm_gain_over_frozen_visual_only\": 20.0,\n587\t      \"ftm_gain_per_million_params_visual\": 4883.0,\n588\t      \"vla_gse_gain_over_frozen_reported\": 12.0,\n589\t      \"vla_gse_gain_per_million_params\": 0.105\n590\t    },\n591\t    \"tables\": [\n592\t      {\n593\t        \"name\": \"Parameter Efficiency Comparison\",\n594\t        \"rows\": [\n595\t          [\n596\t            \"Method\",\n597\t            \"Params\",\n598\t            \"Gain (pp)\",\n599\t            \"Gain/M_params\",\n600\t            \"Coverage\"\n601\t          ],\n602\t          [\n603\t            \"FTM\",\n604\t            \"4K\",\n605\t            \"+20.0 (visual)\",\n606\t            \"4883.0\",\n607\t            \"Visual only\"\n608\t          ],\n609\t          [\n610\t            \"Universal r16\",\n611\t            \"3.7M\",\n612\t            \"+4.9\",\n613\t            \"1.32\",\n614\t            \"All types\"\n615\t          ],\n616\t          [\n617\t            \"Meta-Brain\",\n618\t            \"12.1M\",\n619\t            \"+10.4\",\n620\t            \"0.86\",\n621\t            \"All types\"\n622\t          ],\n623\t          [\n624\t            \"Universal r48\",\n625\t            \"12.0M\",\n626\t            \"+9.7\",\n627\t            \"0.81\",\n628\t            \"All types\"\n629\t          ],\n630\t          [\n631\t            \"VLA-GSE*\",\n632\t            \"114M\",\n633\t            \"+12.0\",\n634\t            \"0.105\",\n635\t            \"All types\"\n636\t          ]\n637\t        ]\n638\t      }\n639\t    ],\n640\t    \"figures\": [],\n641\t    \"analysis\": \"参数效率分析无法为 Meta-Brain 构建有说服力的 narrative。在 reframed paper 中， 应弱化参数效率对比，转而强调 Phase 0 的诊断能力作为独立贡献。scatter plot 仍可保留 但需调整 framing——展示\\\"即使路由未带来效率优势，诊断信号本身仍有独立价值\\\"。\\n\\n\\n参数效率分析在 worst 档下呈现尴尬的对比。Meta-Brain（0.86 gain/M_params）和 rank-48 universal（0.81 gain/M_params）几乎相同——路由架构没有带来参数效率优势。FTM 的参数 效率在视觉领域遥遥领先（4883 gain/M），但覆盖面窄。VLA-GSE 的参数效率最低（0.105）， 但绝对性能最高。Meta-Brain 的定位变得模糊：它既不是参数效率最高的（FTM），也不是 绝对性能最高的（VLA-GSE），在参数匹配比较中甚至不比 simple baseline 好。\\n\"\n642\t  },\n643\t  {\n644\t    \"name\": \"Correction Memory ablation — with/without CM\",\n645\t    \"description\": \"Compare Meta-Brain with and without Correction Memory module.\\n\",\n646\t    \"results\": {\n647\t      \"meta_brain_with_cm_overall\": 64.7,\n648\t      \"meta_brain_without_cm_overall\": 64.0,\n649\t      \"cm_delta_overall\": 0.7,\n650\t      \"cm_delta_visual\": 0.6,\n651\t      \"cm_delta_spatial\": 0.5,\n652\t      \"cm_delta_physical\": 0.6,\n653\t      \"cm_delta_p_value\": 0.35,\n654\t      \"cm_retrieval_accuracy\": 82.4,\n655\t      \"cm_alpha_learned\": 0.12\n656\t    },\n657\t    \"tables\": [\n658\t      {\n659\t        \"name\": \"Correction Memory Ablation\",\n660\t        \"rows\": [\n661\t          [\n662\t            \"Config\",\n663\t            \"Overall (%)\",\n664\t            \"Visual\",\n665\t            \"Spatial\",\n666\t            \"Physical\",\n667\t            \"Δ (pp)\"\n668\t          ],\n669\t          [\n670\t            \"Meta-Brain + CM\",\n671\t            \"64.7 ± 1.7\",\n672\t            \"67.6\",\n673\t            \"62.0\",\n674\t            \"54.6\",\n675\t            \"+0.7\"\n676\t          ],\n677\t          [\n678\t            \"Meta-Brain (no CM)\",\n679\t            \"64.0 ± 1.6\",\n680\t            \"67.0\",\n681\t            \"61.5\",\n682\t            \"54.0\",\n683\t            \"—\"\n684\t          ]\n685\t        ]\n686\t      }\n687\t    ],\n688\t    \"figures\": [],\n689\t    \"analysis\": \"CM 在 worst 档下彻底沦为噪声级贡献。reframed paper 中应在 appendix 用一句话提及 \\\"我们也测试了基于 exemplar 检索的路由调制，增益不显著（+0.7pp, p=0.35），不纳入 主系统\\\"。\\n\\n\\nCM 的 +0.7pp 增益完全不显著（p=0.35），验证了 Dream reviewers 的一致判断：CM 是 padding。Learned alpha=0.12 表明 end-to-end 训练将 CM 的影响权重压到了接近零—— 系统自己\\\"发现\\\"CM 的路由调制不如忽略它。检索准确率 82.4% 看似合理，但下游影响为零 说明问题不在检索质量而在 CM 的设计假设：从历史 exemplar 调制路由权重的价值取决于 路由本身是否有价值，而在 worst 档下路由本身已被证明无效。CM 应从论文中完全删除， 不值得占用 ablation 空间。\\n\"\n690\t  },\n691\t  {\n692\t    \"name\": \"Router architecture comparison — MLP vs linear vs attention\",\n693\t    \"description\": \"Compare PAR variants on PaliGemma layer 6. Test whether routing accuracy translates to downstream task success.\\n\",\n694\t    \"results\": {\n695\t      \"mlp_router_accuracy\": 99.6,\n696\t      \"mlp_downstream_overall\": 64.0,\n697\t      \"linear_router_accuracy\": 98.1,\n698\t      \"linear_downstream_overall\": 63.4,\n699\t      \"attention_router_accuracy\": 99.3,\n700\t      \"attention_downstream_overall\": 63.8,\n701\t      \"accuracy_performance_correlation\": 0.92,\n702\t      \"accuracy_range_pp\": 1.5,\n703\t      \"downstream_range_pp\": 0.6\n704\t    },\n705\t    \"tables\": [\n706\t      {\n707\t        \"name\": \"Router Architecture Comparison\",\n708\t        \"rows\": [\n709\t          [\n710\t            \"Router\",\n711\t            \"Params\",\n712\t            \"Routing Acc (%)\",\n713\t            \"Downstream Overall (%)\",\n714\t            \"Latency (ms)\"\n715\t          ],\n716\t          [\n717\t            \"2-layer MLP\",\n718\t            \"0.53M\",\n719\t            \"99.6\",\n720\t            \"64.0 ± 1.6\",\n721\t            \"0.3\"\n722\t          ],\n723\t          [\n724\t            \"Linear\",\n725\t            \"0.02M\",\n726\t            \"98.1\",\n727\t            \"63.4 ± 1.8\",\n728\t            \"0.1\"\n729\t          ],\n730\t          [\n731\t            \"Attention-based\",\n732\t            \"1.2M\",\n733\t            \"99.3\",\n734\t            \"63.8 ± 1.7\",\n735\t            \"0.8\"\n736\t          ]\n737\t        ]\n738\t      }\n739\t    ],\n740\t    \"figures\": [],\n741\t    \"analysis\": \"Router 架构对比结果支持 reframed paper 的 Phase 0 叙事：线性分类器 98.1% 的准确率 已足够，证明 PaliGemma layer 6 的 representation 是线性可分的。这强化了 \\\"VLA internals encode perturbation type\\\" 的 mechanistic finding。\\n\\n\\n三种路由架构的分类准确率差异为 1.5pp（98.1-99.6%），但下游性能差异仅 0.6pp （63.4-64.0%）。准确率-性能相关性看似高（0.92），但绝对变化量太小——从 98% 提升 到 99.6% 的路由准确率只带来 0.6pp 下游提升。这再次证实 worst 档的核心论点： 路由\\\"质量\\\"不是瓶颈，路由\\\"是否有用\\\"才是问题。即使线性分类器（最简单架构，98.1% 准确率）也几乎达到了 MLP 的下游表现。这对 reframed paper 反而是好消息——Phase 0 的诊断贡献可以说\\\"即使线性分类器也能做到近完美分类\\\"，强化了 representation quality 的 finding。\\n\"\n742\t  },\n743\t  {\n744\t    \"name\": \"6-class vs 3-class routing comparison\",\n745\t    \"description\": \"Compare 6-class fine-grained routing (6 LoRA experts) vs 3-class coarse routing (3 experts). Tests whether finer taxonomy helps.\\n\",\n746\t    \"results\": {\n747\t      \"3class_overall\": 64.0,\n748\t      \"6class_overall\": 64.5,\n749\t      \"6class_visual_camera_expert\": 70.2,\n750\t      \"6class_visual_light_expert\": 72.5,\n751\t      \"6class_visual_bg_expert\": 65.2,\n752\t      \"6class_visual_noise_expert\": 64.0,\n753\t      \"6class_vs_3class_gap\": 0.5,\n754\t      \"6class_total_params\": \"23.2M\",\n755\t      \"marginal_gain_per_expert\": 0.17,\n756\t      \"6class_routing_accuracy\": 96.8\n757\t    },\n758\t    \"tables\": [\n759\t      {\n760\t        \"name\": \"6-class vs 3-class Routing\",\n761\t        \"rows\": [\n762\t          [\n763\t            \"Config\",\n764\t            \"Experts\",\n765\t            \"Total Params\",\n766\t            \"Overall (%)\",\n767\t            \"Δ vs 3-class\"\n768\t          ],\n769\t          [\n770\t            \"3-class routing\",\n771\t            \"3\",\n772\t            \"12.1M\",\n773\t            \"64.0 ± 1.6\",\n774\t            \"—\"\n775\t          ],\n776\t          [\n777\t            \"6-class routing\",\n778\t            \"6\",\n779\t            \"23.2M\",\n780\t            \"64.5 ± 1.7\",\n781\t            \"+0.5\"\n782\t          ],\n783\t          [\n784\t            \"Universal r48\",\n785\t            \"1\",\n786\t            \"12.0M\",\n787\t            \"63.3 ± 1.9\",\n788\t            \"—\"\n789\t          ]\n790\t        ]\n791\t      }\n792\t    ],\n793\t    \"figures\": [],\n794\t    \"analysis\": \"进一步证实 routing 维度上的投资回报极低。reframed paper 中此实验可放在 appendix 作为\\\"我们也探索了更细粒度的分类体系\\\"的脚注。\\n\\n\\n6-class routing 仅比 3-class 高 0.5pp，但参数量从 12M 增加到 23M（几乎翻倍）。 marginal gain per additional expert 仅 0.17pp——完全不值得。原因：在 worst 档下， 即使 3-class 路由已经不比 uniform 好多少，进一步细分类型只是在一个无效维度上做更精细 的划分。6-class routing accuracy（96.8%）略低于 3-class（99.6%），因为 intra-Visual 子类型之间更难区分（Phase 0 已显示 visual subtypes 在表征空间中更接近），但这不影响 结论——问题不在路由精度而在路由本身的价值。有趣的是 camera 和 light 的专门 expert 表现尚可（70-72%），但 noise expert 仅 64%，说明 sensor noise 修正本身就难。\\n\"\n795\t  },\n796\t  {\n797\t    \"name\": \"LoRA rank sweep (r=16/32/64) — capacity bottleneck test\",\n798\t    \"description\": \"Test whether routing benefit grows with expert capacity. Train experts at rank 16/32/64, evaluate with/without routing at each rank.\\n\",\n799\t    \"results\": {\n800\t      \"r16_universal_overall\": 58.5,\n801\t      \"r16_routed_overall\": 59.5,\n802\t      \"r16_routing_benefit\": 1.0,\n803\t      \"r32_universal_overall\": 61.0,\n804\t      \"r32_routed_overall\": 62.2,\n805\t      \"r32_routing_benefit\": 1.2,\n806\t      \"r64_universal_overall\": 65.5,\n807\t      \"r64_routed_overall\": 67.5,\n808\t      \"r64_routing_benefit\": 2.0,\n809\t      \"r64_routed_params\": \"47.8M\",\n810\t      \"r64_universal_params\": \"47.8M\",\n811\t      \"benefit_trend\": \"weakly increasing but not significant at any rank\",\n812\t      \"capacity_threshold_found\": false,\n813\t      \"r16_benefit_p_value\": 0.38,\n814\t      \"r32_benefit_p_value\": 0.29,\n815\t      \"r64_benefit_p_value\": 0.14\n816\t    },\n817\t    \"tables\": [\n818\t      {\n819\t        \"name\": \"Rank Sweep: Routing Benefit vs Capacity\",\n820\t        \"rows\": [\n821\t          [\n822\t            \"Rank\",\n823\t            \"Universal (%)\",\n824\t            \"Routed (%)\",\n825\t            \"Benefit (pp)\",\n826\t            \"p-value\",\n827\t            \"Total Params (Routed)\"\n828\t          ],\n829\t          [\n830\t            \"r=16\",\n831\t            \"58.5 ± 1.7\",\n832\t            \"59.5 ± 1.8\",\n833\t            \"+1.0\",\n834\t            \"0.38\",\n835\t            \"11.6M\"\n836\t          ],\n837\t          [\n838\t            \"r=32\",\n839\t            \"61.0 ± 1.8\",\n840\t            \"62.2 ± 1.9\",\n841\t            \"+1.2\",\n842\t            \"0.29\",\n843\t            \"23.6M\"\n844\t          ],\n845\t          [\n846\t            \"r=64\",\n847\t            \"65.5 ± 1.6\",\n848\t            \"67.5 ± 1.8\",\n849\t            \"+2.0\",\n850\t            \"0.14\",\n851\t            \"47.8M\"\n852\t          ]\n853\t        ]\n854\t      }\n855\t    ],\n856\t    \"figures\": [],\n857\t    \"analysis\": \"Rank sweep 的 \\\"弱上升趋势\\\" 在 reframed paper 中可以有两种解读：(1) 保守解读—— 当前实验范围内无 capacity threshold，routing 在所有测试 rank 上不显著；(2) 乐观解读 （open problem framing）——趋势暗示更高容量的专家可能使路由变得有意义，oracle gap 的存在支持这一推测。reframed paper 应采用解读 (2)，将其定位为 \\\"routing 的潜力需要 更好的 expert training 来释放\\\" 的 evidence。\\n\\n\\nRank sweep 显示路由收益从 r16 的 +1.0pp 缓慢增长到 r64 的 +2.0pp，但在任何 rank 上都不显著（p 最低 0.14）。worst 档假设为\\\"routing benefit is negligible at all ranks tested\\\"得到确认：即使在 r64（每 expert ~16M params）下，路由的 2.0pp 优势仍可能是 噪声。趋势微弱上升，暗示\\\"如果 rank 继续增大可能会显现显著差异\\\"，但在实验范围内 无法证实 capacity threshold 的存在。r64 的绝对性能值得注意：universal r64（65.5%） 已经超过 Meta-Brain r16（64.0%），进一步证实容量 > 路由。如果 rank 加倍的 universal 就能超过路由方案，那路由的工程成本更难以辩护。\\n\"\n858\t  },\n859\t  {\n860\t    \"name\": \"Clean LIBERO evaluation — nominal performance preservation\",\n861\t    \"description\": \"Evaluate Meta-Brain on standard (unperturbed) LIBERO to verify routing does not degrade nominal performance.\\n\",\n862\t    \"results\": {\n863\t      \"frozen_pi0_clean_libero\": 91.2,\n864\t      \"meta_brain_clean_libero\": 87.0,\n865\t      \"universal_r16_clean_libero\": 90.5,\n866\t      \"universal_r48_clean_libero\": 89.8,\n867\t      \"random_routing_clean_libero\": 88.2,\n868\t      \"meta_brain_clean_delta\": -4.2,\n869\t      \"r48_clean_delta\": -1.4,\n870\t      \"r16_clean_delta\": -0.7,\n871\t      \"random_routing_clean_delta\": -3.0,\n872\t      \"meta_brain_clean_delta_p_value\": 0.02\n873\t    },\n874\t    \"tables\": [\n875\t      {\n876\t        \"name\": \"Clean LIBERO Evaluation (Nominal Performance)\",\n877\t        \"rows\": [\n878\t          [\n879\t            \"Method\",\n880\t            \"Clean LIBERO (%)\",\n881\t            \"Δ vs Frozen (pp)\",\n882\t            \"p-value\"\n883\t          ],\n884\t          [\n885\t            \"Frozen pi0\",\n886\t            \"91.2 ± 0.8\",\n887\t            \"—\",\n888\t            \"—\"\n889\t          ],\n890\t          [\n891\t            \"Universal r16\",\n892\t            \"90.5 ± 0.9\",\n893\t            \"-0.7\",\n894\t            \"0.31\"\n895\t          ],\n896\t          [\n897\t            \"Universal r48\",\n898\t            \"89.8 ± 1.0\",\n899\t            \"-1.4\",\n900\t            \"0.08\"\n901\t          ],\n902\t          [\n903\t            \"Random routing\",\n904\t            \"88.2 ± 1.2\",\n905\t            \"-3.0\",\n906\t            \"0.01\"\n907\t          ],\n908\t          [\n909\t            \"Meta-Brain\",\n910\t            \"87.0 ± 1.1\",\n911\t            \"-4.2\",\n912\t            \"0.002\"\n913\t          ]\n914\t        ]\n915\t      }\n916\t    ],\n917\t    \"figures\": [],\n918\t    \"analysis\": \"-4.2pp clean degradation 是 worst 档中对部署叙事的最后一击。任何 practical system 需要在 perturbed 和 clean 条件下都表现良好。Meta-Brain 被 rank-48 universal 在 clean LIBERO 上支配（-1.4 vs -4.2），在 LIBERO-Plus 上又被追平。reframed paper 中应诚实 报告此 trade-off，并讨论 \\\"open-set routing with clean class\\\" 或 \\\"entropy-based routing gating\\\" 作为 future work 来缓解。\\n\\n\\nMeta-Brain 在 clean LIBERO 上掉 4.2pp（91.2→87.0%），且显著（p=0.02）。原因： 路由机制在无扰动输入上仍会激活——PAR router 将 clean observation 错误分类为某种扰动 类型（因为训练数据中没有 \\\"clean\\\" 类别），导致不必要的 LoRA 修正被应用。rank-48 universal 仅掉 1.4pp（89.8%），因为它学到的修正更温和（没有被路由放大）。random routing 掉 3.0pp——也低于 Meta-Brain 的 4.2pp，说明 PAR routing 在 clean input 上 的分类行为比 random 更有害（可能将 clean 集中路由到某个特定 expert，而 random 的 分散反而减轻了单一 expert 的干扰）。这一结果在 worst 档下对实际部署故事是致命的： routing 不仅没帮助（vs rank-48），还在正常条件下引入了可测量的性能退化。\\n\"\n919\t  },\n920\t  {\n921\t    \"name\": \"Cross-backbone validation — SmolVLA or OpenVLA\",\n922\t    \"description\": \"Replicate Phase 0 + Phase 1 core pipeline on a second VLA backbone.\\n\",\n923\t    \"results\": {\n924\t      \"cross_backbone_target\": \"OpenVLA\",\n925\t      \"phase0_3class_f1\": 0.952,\n926\t      \"phase0_best_layer\": 8,\n927\t      \"phase0_k1_f1\": 0.91,\n928\t      \"phase1_universal_r16_overall\": 56.2,\n929\t      \"phase1_meta_brain_overall\": 57.8,\n930\t      \"phase1_routing_gap\": 1.6,\n931\t      \"phase1_routing_gap_significant\": false,\n932\t      \"phase0_linear_separability\": true,\n933\t      \"layer_perturbation_mapping_consistent\": \"partial\"\n934\t    },\n935\t    \"tables\": [\n936\t      {\n937\t        \"name\": \"Cross-Backbone Validation Summary\",\n938\t        \"rows\": [\n939\t          [\n940\t            \"Metric\",\n941\t            \"pi0 (PaliGemma)\",\n942\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n943\t            \"Consistent?\"\n944\t          ],\n945\t          [\n946\t            \"Phase 0 3-class F1\",\n947\t            \"0.993\",\n948\t            \"0.952\",\n949\t            \"Yes (both >0.95)\"\n950\t          ],\n951\t          [\n952\t            \"Best probing layer\",\n953\t            \"Layer 6/18\",\n954\t            \"Layer 8/24\",\n955\t            \"Yes (both ~1/3 depth)\"\n956\t          ],\n957\t          [\n958\t            \"K=1 F1\",\n959\t            \"0.898\",\n960\t            \"0.910\",\n961\t            \"Yes\"\n962\t          ],\n963\t          [\n964\t            \"Routing benefit (pp)\",\n965\t            \"+0.7 (vs r48)\",\n966\t            \"+1.6 (vs r48)\",\n967\t            \"Yes (both <2pp, n.s.)\"\n968\t          ],\n969\t          [\n970\t            \"V→early, S→mid, P→late\",\n971\t            \"Supported\",\n972\t            \"Partial (V→early, P→late)\",\n973\t            \"Partial\"\n974\t          ]\n975\t        ]\n976\t      }\n977\t    ],\n978\t    \"figures\": [],\n979\t    \"analysis\": \"Cross-backbone 结果是 reframed paper 的重要支撑。虽然 routing 在两个 backbone 上都 失败了（进一步削弱 Claim 2），但 Phase 0 diagnostic finding 在两个 backbone 上都 复现——这强化了 reframing 的核心叙事\\\"VLA internals encode perturbation type\\\"。 应将此实验提升为 paper 的重要 evidence，特别是 dual t-SNE figure。\\n\\n\\nPhase 0 在 OpenVLA 上的 3-class F1=0.952（vs pi0 的 0.993），仍然很高但略低。 最佳层从 layer 6 (PaliGemma) 移到 layer 8，与 OpenVLA 的不同架构深度一致。K=1 F1=0.91（vs pi0 的 0.898）也相似。这证实了 Phase 0 的 mechanistic finding 是跨架构 普适的——perturbation type 信息编码在 VLA 内部表征中是一个一般性现象。Phase 1 的 routing gap（+1.6pp, 不显著）复现了 pi0 上的 worst-case 模式——路由在第二个 backbone 上同样无效。layer-perturbation mapping 部分一致（Visual→early 和 Physical→late 复现，Spatial→mid 不明显），可作为 partial corroboration。\\n\"\n980\t  },\n981\t  {\n982\t    \"name\": \"LoRA layer placement ablation\",\n983\t    \"description\": \"Vary which PaliGemma layers receive LoRA experts. Test V→early, S→mid, P→late hypothesis.\\n\",\n984\t    \"results\": {\n985\t      \"lora_v_early_2_6\": 65.5,\n986\t      \"lora_v_mid_6_12\": 63.0,\n987\t      \"lora_v_late_12_18\": 60.2,\n988\t      \"lora_v_all_layers\": 67.0,\n989\t      \"lora_s_early_2_6\": 57.0,\n990\t      \"lora_s_mid_6_12\": 60.5,\n991\t      \"lora_s_late_12_18\": 58.0,\n992\t      \"lora_s_all_layers\": 62.0,\n993\t      \"lora_p_early_2_6\": 48.5,\n994\t      \"lora_p_mid_6_12\": 50.0,\n995\t      \"lora_p_late_12_18\": 52.0,\n996\t      \"lora_p_all_layers\": 55.5,\n997\t      \"visual_prefers_early\": true,\n998\t      \"spatial_prefers_mid\": true,\n999\t      \"physical_prefers_late\": true,\n1000\t      \"best_subset_vs_all_layers_gap_avg\": -3.8\n1001\t    },\n1002\t    \"tables\": [\n1003\t      {\n1004\t        \"name\": \"Layer Placement Ablation (Success Rate %)\",\n1005\t        \"rows\": [\n1006\t          [\n1007\t            \"Expert\",\n1008\t            \"Early (2-6)\",\n1009\t            \"Mid (6-12)\",\n1010\t            \"Late (12-18)\",\n1011\t            \"All Layers\",\n1012\t            \"Best Subset\"\n1013\t          ],\n1014\t          [\n1015\t            \"LoRA-V\",\n1016\t            \"65.5\",\n1017\t            \"63.0\",\n1018\t            \"60.2\",\n1019\t            \"67.0\",\n1020\t            \"Early\"\n1021\t          ],\n1022\t          [\n1023\t            \"LoRA-S\",\n1024\t            \"57.0\",\n1025\t            \"60.5\",\n1026\t            \"58.0\",\n1027\t            \"62.0\",\n1028\t            \"Mid\"\n1029\t          ],\n1030\t          [\n1031\t            \"LoRA-P\",\n1032\t            \"48.5\",\n1033\t            \"50.0\",\n1034\t            \"52.0\",\n1035\t            \"55.5\",\n1036\t            \"Late\"\n1037\t          ]\n1038\t        ]\n1039\t      }\n1040\t    ],\n1041\t    \"figures\": [],\n1042\t    \"analysis\": \"Layer placement 结果是 reframed paper 的第二个 mechanistic finding。V→early/S→mid/ P→late 的层偏好与 Phase 0 的 probing 峰值对齐，共同构成\\\"VLA 内部按处理阶段编码 不同类型扰动信息\\\"的 narrative。在 reframed paper 中，此结果应被呈现为\\\"architecture design insight for future VLA robustness methods\\\"——即使当前路由无效，了解扰动信息 的空间分布对设计下一代 VLA 有价值。\\n\\nLayer placement 结果弱支持 V→early, S→mid, P→late 假设：LoRA-V 在 early 层 （65.5%）优于 mid（63.0%）和 late（60.2%）；LoRA-S 在 mid（60.5%）最佳；LoRA-P 在 late（52.0%）最佳。但关键问题是所有 subset placement 都显著低于 all-layers （差距 1.5-7pp），说明即使存在层偏好，全层覆盖的额外容量仍更重要。这与 worst 档 叙事一致——容量 > 精确定位。层偏好的存在为 Phase 0 的 mechanistic finding 提供了 支撑（early layers 处理视觉信息，late layers 处理动作规划），但不足以支持基于层 分配的架构设计——收益不值得精确定位的工程成本。\\n\"\n1043\t  }\n1044\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"009b5f02-a0d7-4a14-b176-7ec94b5b2bc9","uuid":"b3928596-b7bb-4aa6-83f7-b51bc4dcf11d","timestamp":"2026-05-15T18:05:10.511Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515/projects/meta_brain_lora_routing/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T165902/worst/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LoRA expert training — 3 perturbation-specific + 1 universal baseline\",\n    \"description\": \"Train 4 LoRA adapters (rank 16, ~3.7M each) on frozen pi0 PaliGemma attention layers. LoRA-V on visual augmented data, LoRA-S on spatial perturbation rollouts, LoRA-P on physical perturbation rollouts, Universal on mixed data. Evaluate each on own type and cross-type.\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"lora_v_on_visual\": 67.0,\n      \"lora_v_on_spatial\": 58.0,\n      \"lora_v_on_physical\": 49.5,\n      \"lora_s_on_visual\": 62.5,\n      \"lora_s_on_spatial\": 62.0,\n      \"lora_s_on_physical\": 50.0,\n      \"lora_p_on_visual\": 61.0,\n      \"lora_p_on_spatial\": 57.5,\n      \"lora_p_on_physical\": 55.5,\n      \"universal_r16_on_visual\": 61.5,\n      \"universal_r16_on_spatial\": 56.0,\n      \"universal_r16_on_physical\": 49.0,\n      \"universal_r16_overall\": 58.5,\n      \"cross_type_avg_drop_pp\": 4.7,\n      \"lora_v_training_loss_final\": 0.018,\n      \"lora_s_training_loss_final\": 0.022,\n      \"lora_p_training_loss_final\": 0.031,\n      \"convergence_epochs_v\": 12,\n      \"convergence_epochs_s\": 18,\n      \"convergence_epochs_p\": 25\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Expert × Perturbation Type Cross-Evaluation Matrix (Success Rate %)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Method\",\n            \"Visual\",\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"Physical\",\n            \"Overall\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LoRA-V (rank 16)\",\n            \"67.0 ± 2.1\",\n            \"58.0 ± 2.8\",\n            \"49.5 ± 3.2\",\n            \"60.8 ± 1.9\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LoRA-S (rank 16)\",\n            \"62.5 ± 2.4\",\n            \"62.0 ± 2.6\",\n            \"50.0 ± 3.0\",\n            \"59.7 ± 1.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LoRA-P (rank 16)\",\n            \"61.0 ± 2.5\",\n            \"57.5 ± 2.9\",\n            \"55.5 ± 3.1\",\n            \"59.2 ± 2.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Universal (rank 16)\",\n            \"61.5 ± 2.3\",\n            \"56.0 ± 2.7\",\n            \"49.0 ± 3.3\",\n            \"58.5 ± 1.7\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Frozen pi0\",\n            \"51.2 ± 1.8\",\n            \"57.4 ± 2.5\",\n            \"54.8 ± 2.9\",\n            \"53.6 ± 1.5\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Cross-Type Mismatch Drop (pp)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Perturbation Type\",\n            \"Matched Expert\",\n            \"Best Mismatched\",\n            \"Drop (pp)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Visual\",\n            \"LoRA-V: 67.0\",\n            \"LoRA-S: 62.5\",\n            \"4.5\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"LoRA-S: 62.0\",\n            \"LoRA-V: 58.0\",\n            \"4.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Physical\",\n            \"LoRA-P: 55.5\",\n            \"LoRA-S: 50.0\",\n            \"5.5\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"worst 档的核心证据出现：cross-type drop 平均仅 4.7pp，远低于证明类型特异性路由价值 所需的 >10pp 阈值。LoRA-S 在 Visual 上达 62.5%（仅比 LoRA-V 低 4.5pp）是致命的—— 这意味着一个为空间扰动训练的适配器几乎可以胜任视觉扰动修正。Physical 类型的绝对性能 低（最高仅 55.5%）表明 rank 16 LoRA 根本无法有效修正物理扰动。注意 Universal r16 的 58.5% 并不差——它在各类型上接近中位数表现，证实 \\\"混合训练 + 更多参数\\\" 可能优于 \\\"专家路由\\\"。\\n\\n\\n在 worst 档下，专家之间的交叉类型性能下降很小（平均 ~4.7pp），核心原因是 LoRA rank 16 的容量不足以学到真正类型特异性的修正模式。各专家在自身类型上的优势主要来自训练数据分布 匹配，而非学到了质性不同的修正函数。LoRA-V 在 Visual 上最强（67%）是因为视觉增强的 训练范式（FTM 式）天然适配 LoRA 微调，但当 LoRA-S 被错误应用于 Visual 时仍达 62.5% （仅降 4.5pp），说明 LoRA-S 学到的修正在空间上和视觉修正高度重叠。Physical 类型整体 最弱（LoRA-P 仅 55.5%），因为物理扰动改变了力学和接触动态，需要更深层的动作策略调整， 而不仅是表征修正。Universal LoRA r16 的整体 58.5% 已经接近各专家在自身类型上的平均水平， 进一步证实容量而非路由是主要瓶颈。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Meta-Brain assembly — PAR router + LoRA bank end-to-end\",\n    \"description\": \"Assemble PAR router (PaliGemma layer 6, 2-layer MLP) + 3 LoRA experts with soft routing. End-to-end routing fine-tuning with frozen LoRA parameters. Evaluate on full LIBERO-Plus.\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"libero_plus_overall\": 64.0,\n      \"visual_overall\": 67.0,\n      \"visual_camera\": 69.5,\n      \"visual_light\": 71.0,\n      \"visual_background\": 64.0,\n      \"visual_noise\": 63.5,\n      \"spatial_layout\": 61.5,\n      \"physical_robot\": 54.0,\n      \"routing_weight_visual_to_lora_v\": 0.58,\n      \"routing_weight_visual_to_lora_s\": 0.24,\n      \"routing_weight_visual_to_lora_p\": 0.18,\n      \"routing_weight_spatial_to_lora_s\": 0.52,\n      \"routing_weight_spatial_to_lora_v\": 0.28,\n      \"routing_weight_spatial_to_lora_p\": 0.2,\n      \"routing_weight_physical_to_lora_p\": 0.48,\n      \"routing_weight_physical_to_lora_v\": 0.22,\n      \"routing_weight_physical_to_lora_s\": 0.3,\n      \"par_router_online_accuracy\": 97.8,\n      \"routing_entropy_visual\": 1.32,\n      \"routing_entropy_spatial\": 1.41,\n      \"routing_entropy_physical\": 1.48\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Meta-Brain LIBERO-Plus Per-Perturbation Breakdown\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Perturbation\",\n            \"Type\",\n            \"Meta-Brain (%)\",\n            \"Frozen pi0 (%)\",\n            \"Δ (pp)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"camera\",\n            \"Visual\",\n            \"69.5 ± 2.4\",\n            \"49.0 ± 2.0\",\n            \"+20.5\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"light\",\n            \"Visual\",\n            \"71.0 ± 2.2\",\n            \"55.2 ± 1.9\",\n            \"+15.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"background\",\n            \"Visual\",\n            \"64.0 ± 2.6\",\n            \"57.0 ± 2.2\",\n            \"+7.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"noise\",\n            \"Visual\",\n            \"63.5 ± 2.7\",\n            \"47.6 ± 2.1\",\n            \"+15.9\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"layout\",\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"61.5 ± 2.8\",\n            \"57.4 ± 2.5\",\n            \"+4.1\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"robot\",\n            \"Physical\",\n            \"54.0 ± 3.2\",\n            \"54.8 ± 2.9\",\n            \"-0.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Overall\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"64.0 ± 1.6\",\n            \"53.6 ± 1.5\",\n            \"+10.4\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"PAR Soft Routing Weight Matrix\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"True Type\",\n            \"→ LoRA-V\",\n            \"→ LoRA-S\",\n            \"→ LoRA-P\",\n            \"Entropy\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Visual\",\n            \"0.58\",\n            \"0.24\",\n            \"0.18\",\n            \"1.32\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"0.28\",\n            \"0.52\",\n            \"0.20\",\n            \"1.41\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Physical\",\n            \"0.22\",\n            \"0.30\",\n            \"0.48\",\n            \"1.48\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Meta-Brain 的整体表现（64.0%）看似合理，但关键问题在路由行为。PAR router 的 online classification accuracy 仍高达 97.8%（与 Phase 0 一致），但 end-to-end fine-tuning 后路由权重没有收敛到 one-hot。这意味着系统\\\"发现\\\"混合使用专家比严格路由更有效—— 这是 Claim 2 崩塌的直接信号。Physical 类型的 -0.8pp（比 frozen 还低）尤其致命： 路由不仅没帮助，反而因为将部分权重分配给不相关的专家而引入了干扰。\\n\\n\\n整体 64.0% 在 worst 范围 [58, 68] 内。路由权重分布是最关键的诊断信号：soft routing 没有收敛到接近 one-hot 的分配（理想情况下对角线应 >0.85），而是呈现分散的权重分布。 Visual 类型最好的情况也仅将 58% 的权重分配给 LoRA-V，剩余 42% 分散给 S 和 P。 Physical 类型甚至只有 48% 分配给 LoRA-P，30% 给了 LoRA-S。这直接证实了 end-to-end fine-tuning 发现 \\\"混合使用多个专家\\\" 比 \\\"路由到正确专家\\\" 更有效——系统退化为了隐式的 软集成（soft ensemble），而非真正的类型特异性路由。路由熵在 1.3-1.5 之间（最大熵 log(3)=1.58），接近均匀分布。Physical 类型的低绝对性能（54.0%，仅比 frozen +0.8pp 的 delta 中 Physical 类型贡献最小）再次确认物理扰动修正是瓶颈。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Oracle routing ablation — upper bound for routing quality\",\n    \"description\": \"Replace PAR router with ground-truth perturbation type labels (hard one-hot routing). Measures ceiling for routing quality.\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"oracle_overall\": 69.9,\n      \"oracle_visual\": 73.0,\n      \"oracle_spatial\": 68.0,\n      \"oracle_physical\": 59.5,\n      \"oracle_minus_meta_brain_overall\": 5.9,\n      \"oracle_minus_meta_brain_visual\": 6.0,\n      \"oracle_minus_meta_brain_spatial\": 6.5,\n      \"oracle_minus_meta_brain_physical\": 5.5,\n      \"oracle_minus_frozen\": 16.3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Oracle vs PAR Routing Comparison\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Method\",\n            \"Visual\",\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"Physical\",\n            \"Overall\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Oracle routing\",\n            \"73.0 ± 1.8\",\n            \"68.0 ± 2.3\",\n            \"59.5 ± 2.7\",\n            \"69.9 ± 1.4\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Meta-Brain (PAR)\",\n            \"67.0 ± 2.1\",\n            \"61.5 ± 2.8\",\n            \"54.0 ± 3.2\",\n            \"64.0 ± 1.6\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Gap (pp)\",\n            \"+6.0\",\n            \"+6.5\",\n            \"+5.5\",\n            \"+5.9\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"5.9pp 的 oracle gap 在 worst 范围 [5, 12] 的低端，但仍然显著。关键洞察：oracle 的 优势不等于 \\\"PAR router 不够准\\\"（PAR accuracy >97%），而是 hard routing vs soft routing 的结构性差异。这为 \\\"open problem\\\" 叙事提供了素材：如果能训练出更 specialized 的专家， routing 的价值可以释放。但在当前实验设定下，这只是一个未兑现的 promise。\\n\\n\\nOracle routing（69.9%）显著高于 Meta-Brain（64.0%），gap 达 5.9pp。这一结果的解释 是双面的：(1) 它证明了路由\\\"原则上\\\"有价值——完美路由比 Meta-Brain 的 soft-ensemble 好 6pp；(2) 但它同时证明当前专家不够 specialized——即使完美路由，oracle 也只比 rank-48 universal（63.3%）高 6.6pp。对比理想情况：如果专家真的学到了完全不同的修正模式， oracle 应该接近各专家在自身类型上的最佳表现的加权平均（~64.5%），但 oracle 的 69.9% 远高于此。这说明 one-hot hard routing 的优势不在于\\\"选对专家\\\"，而在于避免了 soft routing 带来的专家间干扰——当错误专家的权重为零时，修正信号更纯净。Physical 类型的 oracle（59.5%）仍然偏低，进一步确认 LoRA-P 的能力上限受限于 rank 16 容量。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Ablation ladder — Frozen → Universal LoRA → Random → Meta-Brain → Oracle\",\n    \"description\": \"Systematic comparison on LIBERO-Plus with 5 seeds. Core evidence for Claim 2. Includes rank-48 parameter-matched control from plan_013.\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"frozen_pi0_overall\": 53.6,\n      \"universal_r16_overall\": 58.5,\n      \"universal_r48_overall\": 63.3,\n      \"random_routing_overall\": 62.4,\n      \"meta_brain_overall\": 64.0,\n      \"meta_brain_plus_cm_overall\": 64.7,\n      \"oracle_routing_overall\": 69.9,\n      \"meta_brain_vs_frozen_gain\": 10.4,\n      \"meta_brain_vs_r48_gap\": 0.7,\n      \"meta_brain_vs_random_gap\": 1.6,\n      \"meta_brain_vs_r48_p_value\": 0.42,\n      \"meta_brain_vs_random_p_value\": 0.18,\n      \"oracle_vs_meta_brain_gap\": 5.9,\n      \"seeds_std_frozen\": 1.5,\n      \"seeds_std_r16\": 1.7,\n      \"seeds_std_r48\": 1.9,\n      \"seeds_std_random\": 2.2,\n      \"seeds_std_meta_brain\": 1.6,\n      \"seeds_std_oracle\": 1.4\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Complete Ablation Ladder (LIBERO-Plus, 5 seeds)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Method\",\n            \"Params\",\n            \"Overall (%)\",\n            \"Visual\",\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"Physical\",\n            \"Δ vs Frozen\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Frozen pi0\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"53.6 ± 1.5\",\n            \"51.2\",\n            \"57.4\",\n            \"54.8\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Universal r16\",\n            \"3.7M\",\n            \"58.5 ± 1.7\",\n            \"61.5\",\n            \"56.0\",\n            \"49.0\",\n            \"+4.9\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Universal r48\",\n            \"12.0M\",\n            \"63.3 ± 1.9\",\n            \"66.5\",\n            \"61.0\",\n            \"53.0\",\n            \"+9.7\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Random routing\",\n            \"11.6M\",\n            \"62.4 ± 2.2\",\n            \"65.5\",\n            \"60.0\",\n            \"52.5\",\n            \"+8.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Meta-Brain (PAR)\",\n            \"12.1M\",\n            \"64.0 ± 1.6\",\n            \"67.0\",\n            \"61.5\",\n            \"54.0\",\n            \"+10.4\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Meta-Brain + CM\",\n            \"12.1M+\",\n            \"64.7 ± 1.7\",\n            \"67.6\",\n            \"62.0\",\n            \"54.6\",\n            \"+11.1\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Oracle routing\",\n            \"11.6M\",\n            \"69.9 ± 1.4\",\n            \"73.0\",\n            \"68.0\",\n            \"59.5\",\n            \"+16.3\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Statistical Significance Tests (paired t-test, 5 seeds)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Comparison\",\n            \"Δ (pp)\",\n            \"t-statistic\",\n            \"p-value\",\n            \"Significant?\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Meta-Brain vs Frozen\",\n            \"+10.4\",\n            \"8.12\",\n            \"0.001\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Meta-Brain vs Universal r16\",\n            \"+5.5\",\n            \"4.31\",\n            \"0.013\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Meta-Brain vs Universal r48\",\n            \"+0.7\",\n            \"0.88\",\n            \"0.42\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Meta-Brain vs Random\",\n            \"+1.6\",\n            \"1.56\",\n            \"0.18\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Oracle vs Meta-Brain\",\n            \"+5.9\",\n            \"5.87\",\n            \"0.004\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Random vs Universal r16\",\n            \"+3.9\",\n            \"3.02\",\n            \"0.039\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Ablation ladder 的数据模式彻底否定了 Claim 2。三个关键观察：(1) Rank-48 universal （63.3%）几乎等于 Meta-Brain（64.0%），gap=0.7pp 不显著（p=0.42）——参数缩放完全 替代了路由；(2) Random routing（62.4%）接近 Meta-Brain（gap=1.6pp, p=0.18）——集成 效应解释了大部分多专家收益；(3) Oracle（69.9%）显著高于 Meta-Brain（gap=5.9pp, p=0.004）——理论上路由有价值，但当前专家训练无法实现。有趣的是 Random > r16（+3.9pp, p=0.039），说明 3×rank-16 的参数量加上多样性确实比 1×rank-16 好，但这是参数+集成 效应，与路由无关。\\n\\n\\n这是 worst 档的核心毁灭性实验。Meta-Brain（64.0%）仅比 rank-48 universal（63.3%） 高 0.7pp，p=0.42——统计上完全不显著。Meta-Brain 比 random routing（62.4%）高 1.6pp， p=0.18——仍不显著（需 <0.05）。这意味着：(1) 路由对比容量缩放无优势——多花在路由器 上的参数不如直接增加 LoRA rank；(2) 随机分配专家（纯集成效应）已经捕获了多专家结构 的大部分收益。Random routing 的 62.4% 表明 3 个 rank-16 LoRA 的\\\"多样性集成\\\"本身 就比单个 rank-16 好 4pp，但这是集成效应而非路由效应。5 seeds 下的标准差在 1.4-2.2pp 范围，meta_brain_vs_r48 的 0.7pp gap 完全落在噪声范围内。Claim 2 在统计意义上被 判定为 NOT SUPPORTED。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Rank-48 parameter-matched universal LoRA — existential control\",\n    \"description\": \"Train single universal LoRA with rank 48 (~12M params) matching Meta-Brain's total parameter budget. The #1 critical experiment: if r48 ≈ Meta-Brain, Claim 2 collapses.\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"rank48_universal_overall\": 63.3,\n      \"rank48_visual\": 66.5,\n      \"rank48_spatial\": 61.0,\n      \"rank48_physical\": 53.0,\n      \"rank48_vs_meta_brain_gap\": -0.7,\n      \"rank48_vs_r16_gain\": 4.8,\n      \"rank48_training_loss_final\": 0.015,\n      \"rank48_convergence_epoch\": 15,\n      \"claim2_survival\": false\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Parameter-Matched Comparison: Universal r48 vs Meta-Brain\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Metric\",\n            \"Universal r48\",\n            \"Meta-Brain\",\n            \"Δ\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Params (trainable)\",\n            \"12.0M\",\n            \"12.1M\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Overall (%)\",\n            \"63.3 ± 1.9\",\n            \"64.0 ± 1.6\",\n            \"+0.7\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Visual (%)\",\n            \"66.5\",\n            \"67.0\",\n            \"+0.5\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Spatial (%)\",\n            \"61.0\",\n            \"61.5\",\n            \"+0.5\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Physical (%)\",\n            \"53.0\",\n            \"54.0\",\n            \"+1.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Architecture complexity\",\n            \"Single LoRA\",\n            \"Router + 3 LoRA + merge\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Inference overhead\",\n            \"None\",\n            \"Router forward pass\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"这是 worst 档最致命的单一实验结果。r48 universal 证明了一个简单的推论：如果你有 12M 参数预算，把它们全部给一个 LoRA 和把它们分成 3 份再加路由器效果一样。路由的额外架构 复杂度（router 训练、soft-merge 计算、在线分类）变成了纯粹的工程开销而非性能收益。 在 reframing 叙事中，这一结果应被诚实报告并解读为\\\"路由的价值需要更 specialized 的 专家来解锁\\\"——指向 oracle gap 作为 open problem。\\n\\n\\nRank-48 universal 达到 63.3%，仅比 Meta-Brain 低 0.7pp——Claim 2 的 existential control 判定为 FAIL。原因：当 LoRA rank 从 16 提升到 48 时，单一适配器获得了足够的 表征容量来同时处理所有扰动类型。Rank 16 的\\\"容量瓶颈\\\"迫使 universal LoRA 做 trade-off （Visual 好但 Physical 差），但 rank 48 消除了这个 trade-off。在 Visual 上 rank-48 （66.5%）已经接近 LoRA-V 专家（67.0%），说明额外的 rank 足以学到视觉修正所需的所有 模式，无需专门训练。Physical 上 rank-48（53.0%）略低于 LoRA-P（55.5%），但差距可忽略。 这证明参数预算等效时，将 12M 参数分配给一个 rank-48 适配器与分配给 3 个 rank-16 专家加一个路由器效果相同——路由的工程复杂度没有带来性能回报。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"FTM/FLA reproduction — visual-only baseline comparison\",\n    \"description\": \"Reproduce FTM on pi0 for visual perturbation types. Compare Meta-Brain LoRA-V vs FTM.\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"ftm_on_visual_overall\": 71.2,\n      \"ftm_on_camera\": 74.0,\n      \"ftm_on_light\": 75.5,\n      \"ftm_on_background\": 68.0,\n      \"ftm_on_noise\": 67.3,\n      \"ftm_params\": 4096,\n      \"lora_v_on_visual_overall\": 67.0,\n      \"meta_brain_on_visual_overall\": 67.0,\n      \"ftm_vs_lora_v_gap\": 4.2,\n      \"ftm_on_spatial\": 55.0,\n      \"ftm_on_physical\": 52.0,\n      \"meta_brain_advantage_on_non_visual\": 7.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"FTM vs Meta-Brain Comparison\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Method\",\n            \"Params\",\n            \"Visual\",\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"Physical\",\n            \"Overall\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"FTM (reproduced)\",\n            \"4K\",\n            \"71.2\",\n            \"55.0\",\n            \"52.0\",\n            \"62.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Meta-Brain\",\n            \"12.1M\",\n            \"67.0\",\n            \"61.5\",\n            \"54.0\",\n            \"64.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LoRA-V only\",\n            \"3.7M\",\n            \"67.0\",\n            \"58.0\",\n            \"49.5\",\n            \"60.8\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"FTM 的强势表现为 reframed paper 提供了有用的参照：Meta-Brain 的路由设计初衷是\\\"比 FTM 更全面\\\"，但在 worst 档下，它在 FTM 的强项（视觉）上弱于 FTM，在自己的差异化 方向（spatial/physical）上又只比 frozen 提升几个点。reframing 策略应避免与 FTM 直接比较参数效率，而聚焦于 Phase 0 的诊断能力——FTM 不知道自己在修正什么类型的 扰动，Meta-Brain 知道但未能有效利用这一知识。\\n\\n\\nFTM 在视觉扰动上达到 71.2%，显著优于 Meta-Brain 的 67.0%（gap=4.2pp），且仅用 4K 参数（vs Meta-Brain 12M）。原因：FTM 的 fine-tuning + masking 策略专门针对视觉通道 优化，是一个更 \\\"tight\\\" 的视觉修正工具；而 Meta-Brain 的 LoRA-V 是通用 LoRA 架构， 在视觉修正上不如定制方法高效。Meta-Brain 的优势理论上在非视觉类型：Meta-Brain spatial=61.5, physical=54.0 vs FTM spatial=55.0, physical=52.0，但这一 \\\"全面性\\\" 优势在 worst 档下被 rank-48 universal 的等效表现所消解——为什么要用一个复杂路由系统 来获得\\\"全面但每项都不如专门方法\\\"的结果？\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Parameter efficiency analysis — gain-over-baseline vs trainable params\",\n    \"description\": \"Compute gain-over-frozen-baseline per method, normalize by trainable parameters. Generate parameter efficiency scatter plot.\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"meta_brain_gain_over_frozen\": 10.4,\n      \"meta_brain_gain_per_million_params\": 0.86,\n      \"universal_r48_gain_over_frozen\": 9.7,\n      \"universal_r48_gain_per_million_params\": 0.81,\n      \"universal_r16_gain_over_frozen\": 4.9,\n      \"universal_r16_gain_per_million_params\": 1.32,\n      \"ftm_gain_over_frozen_visual_only\": 20.0,\n      \"ftm_gain_per_million_params_visual\": 4883.0,\n      \"vla_gse_gain_over_frozen_reported\": 12.0,\n      \"vla_gse_gain_per_million_params\": 0.105\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Parameter Efficiency Comparison\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Method\",\n            \"Params\",\n            \"Gain (pp)\",\n            \"Gain/M_params\",\n            \"Coverage\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"FTM\",\n            \"4K\",\n            \"+20.0 (visual)\",\n            \"4883.0\",\n            \"Visual only\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Universal r16\",\n            \"3.7M\",\n            \"+4.9\",\n            \"1.32\",\n            \"All types\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Meta-Brain\",\n            \"12.1M\",\n            \"+10.4\",\n            \"0.86\",\n            \"All types\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Universal r48\",\n            \"12.0M\",\n            \"+9.7\",\n            \"0.81\",\n            \"All types\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VLA-GSE*\",\n            \"114M\",\n            \"+12.0\",\n            \"0.105\",\n            \"All types\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"参数效率分析无法为 Meta-Brain 构建有说服力的 narrative。在 reframed paper 中， 应弱化参数效率对比，转而强调 Phase 0 的诊断能力作为独立贡献。scatter plot 仍可保留 但需调整 framing——展示\\\"即使路由未带来效率优势，诊断信号本身仍有独立价值\\\"。\\n\\n\\n参数效率分析在 worst 档下呈现尴尬的对比。Meta-Brain（0.86 gain/M_params）和 rank-48 universal（0.81 gain/M_params）几乎相同——路由架构没有带来参数效率优势。FTM 的参数 效率在视觉领域遥遥领先（4883 gain/M），但覆盖面窄。VLA-GSE 的参数效率最低（0.105）， 但绝对性能最高。Meta-Brain 的定位变得模糊：它既不是参数效率最高的（FTM），也不是 绝对性能最高的（VLA-GSE），在参数匹配比较中甚至不比 simple baseline 好。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Correction Memory ablation — with/without CM\",\n    \"description\": \"Compare Meta-Brain with and without Correction Memory module.\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"meta_brain_with_cm_overall\": 64.7,\n      \"meta_brain_without_cm_overall\": 64.0,\n      \"cm_delta_overall\": 0.7,\n      \"cm_delta_visual\": 0.6,\n      \"cm_delta_spatial\": 0.5,\n      \"cm_delta_physical\": 0.6,\n      \"cm_delta_p_value\": 0.35,\n      \"cm_retrieval_accuracy\": 82.4,\n      \"cm_alpha_learned\": 0.12\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Correction Memory Ablation\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Config\",\n            \"Overall (%)\",\n            \"Visual\",\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"Physical\",\n            \"Δ (pp)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Meta-Brain + CM\",\n            \"64.7 ± 1.7\",\n            \"67.6\",\n            \"62.0\",\n            \"54.6\",\n            \"+0.7\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Meta-Brain (no CM)\",\n            \"64.0 ± 1.6\",\n            \"67.0\",\n            \"61.5\",\n            \"54.0\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"CM 在 worst 档下彻底沦为噪声级贡献。reframed paper 中应在 appendix 用一句话提及 \\\"我们也测试了基于 exemplar 检索的路由调制，增益不显著（+0.7pp, p=0.35），不纳入 主系统\\\"。\\n\\n\\nCM 的 +0.7pp 增益完全不显著（p=0.35），验证了 Dream reviewers 的一致判断：CM 是 padding。Learned alpha=0.12 表明 end-to-end 训练将 CM 的影响权重压到了接近零—— 系统自己\\\"发现\\\"CM 的路由调制不如忽略它。检索准确率 82.4% 看似合理，但下游影响为零 说明问题不在检索质量而在 CM 的设计假设：从历史 exemplar 调制路由权重的价值取决于 路由本身是否有价值，而在 worst 档下路由本身已被证明无效。CM 应从论文中完全删除， 不值得占用 ablation 空间。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Router architecture comparison — MLP vs linear vs attention\",\n    \"description\": \"Compare PAR variants on PaliGemma layer 6. Test whether routing accuracy translates to downstream task success.\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"mlp_router_accuracy\": 99.6,\n      \"mlp_downstream_overall\": 64.0,\n      \"linear_router_accuracy\": 98.1,\n      \"linear_downstream_overall\": 63.4,\n      \"attention_router_accuracy\": 99.3,\n      \"attention_downstream_overall\": 63.8,\n      \"accuracy_performance_correlation\": 0.92,\n      \"accuracy_range_pp\": 1.5,\n      \"downstream_range_pp\": 0.6\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Router Architecture Comparison\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Router\",\n            \"Params\",\n            \"Routing Acc (%)\",\n            \"Downstream Overall (%)\",\n            \"Latency (ms)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2-layer MLP\",\n            \"0.53M\",\n            \"99.6\",\n            \"64.0 ± 1.6\",\n            \"0.3\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Linear\",\n            \"0.02M\",\n            \"98.1\",\n            \"63.4 ± 1.8\",\n            \"0.1\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Attention-based\",\n            \"1.2M\",\n            \"99.3\",\n            \"63.8 ± 1.7\",\n            \"0.8\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Router 架构对比结果支持 reframed paper 的 Phase 0 叙事：线性分类器 98.1% 的准确率 已足够，证明 PaliGemma layer 6 的 representation 是线性可分的。这强化了 \\\"VLA internals encode perturbation type\\\" 的 mechanistic finding。\\n\\n\\n三种路由架构的分类准确率差异为 1.5pp（98.1-99.6%），但下游性能差异仅 0.6pp （63.4-64.0%）。准确率-性能相关性看似高（0.92），但绝对变化量太小——从 98% 提升 到 99.6% 的路由准确率只带来 0.6pp 下游提升。这再次证实 worst 档的核心论点： 路由\\\"质量\\\"不是瓶颈，路由\\\"是否有用\\\"才是问题。即使线性分类器（最简单架构，98.1% 准确率）也几乎达到了 MLP 的下游表现。这对 reframed paper 反而是好消息——Phase 0 的诊断贡献可以说\\\"即使线性分类器也能做到近完美分类\\\"，强化了 representation quality 的 finding。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"6-class vs 3-class routing comparison\",\n    \"description\": \"Compare 6-class fine-grained routing (6 LoRA experts) vs 3-class coarse routing (3 experts). Tests whether finer taxonomy helps.\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"3class_overall\": 64.0,\n      \"6class_overall\": 64.5,\n      \"6class_visual_camera_expert\": 70.2,\n      \"6class_visual_light_expert\": 72.5,\n      \"6class_visual_bg_expert\": 65.2,\n      \"6class_visual_noise_expert\": 64.0,\n      \"6class_vs_3class_gap\": 0.5,\n      \"6class_total_params\": \"23.2M\",\n      \"marginal_gain_per_expert\": 0.17,\n      \"6class_routing_accuracy\": 96.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"6-class vs 3-class Routing\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Config\",\n            \"Experts\",\n            \"Total Params\",\n            \"Overall (%)\",\n            \"Δ vs 3-class\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"3-class routing\",\n            \"3\",\n            \"12.1M\",\n            \"64.0 ± 1.6\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"6-class routing\",\n            \"6\",\n            \"23.2M\",\n            \"64.5 ± 1.7\",\n            \"+0.5\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Universal r48\",\n            \"1\",\n            \"12.0M\",\n            \"63.3 ± 1.9\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"进一步证实 routing 维度上的投资回报极低。reframed paper 中此实验可放在 appendix 作为\\\"我们也探索了更细粒度的分类体系\\\"的脚注。\\n\\n\\n6-class routing 仅比 3-class 高 0.5pp，但参数量从 12M 增加到 23M（几乎翻倍）。 marginal gain per additional expert 仅 0.17pp——完全不值得。原因：在 worst 档下， 即使 3-class 路由已经不比 uniform 好多少，进一步细分类型只是在一个无效维度上做更精细 的划分。6-class routing accuracy（96.8%）略低于 3-class（99.6%），因为 intra-Visual 子类型之间更难区分（Phase 0 已显示 visual subtypes 在表征空间中更接近），但这不影响 结论——问题不在路由精度而在路由本身的价值。有趣的是 camera 和 light 的专门 expert 表现尚可（70-72%），但 noise expert 仅 64%，说明 sensor noise 修正本身就难。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LoRA rank sweep (r=16/32/64) — capacity bottleneck test\",\n    \"description\": \"Test whether routing benefit grows with expert capacity. Train experts at rank 16/32/64, evaluate with/without routing at each rank.\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"r16_universal_overall\": 58.5,\n      \"r16_routed_overall\": 59.5,\n      \"r16_routing_benefit\": 1.0,\n      \"r32_universal_overall\": 61.0,\n      \"r32_routed_overall\": 62.2,\n      \"r32_routing_benefit\": 1.2,\n      \"r64_universal_overall\": 65.5,\n      \"r64_routed_overall\": 67.5,\n      \"r64_routing_benefit\": 2.0,\n      \"r64_routed_params\": \"47.8M\",\n      \"r64_universal_params\": \"47.8M\",\n      \"benefit_trend\": \"weakly increasing but not significant at any rank\",\n      \"capacity_threshold_found\": false,\n      \"r16_benefit_p_value\": 0.38,\n      \"r32_benefit_p_value\": 0.29,\n      \"r64_benefit_p_value\": 0.14\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Rank Sweep: Routing Benefit vs Capacity\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Rank\",\n            \"Universal (%)\",\n            \"Routed (%)\",\n            \"Benefit (pp)\",\n            \"p-value\",\n            \"Total Params (Routed)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"r=16\",\n            \"58.5 ± 1.7\",\n            \"59.5 ± 1.8\",\n            \"+1.0\",\n            \"0.38\",\n            \"11.6M\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"r=32\",\n            \"61.0 ± 1.8\",\n            \"62.2 ± 1.9\",\n            \"+1.2\",\n            \"0.29\",\n            \"23.6M\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"r=64\",\n            \"65.5 ± 1.6\",\n            \"67.5 ± 1.8\",\n            \"+2.0\",\n            \"0.14\",\n            \"47.8M\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Rank sweep 的 \\\"弱上升趋势\\\" 在 reframed paper 中可以有两种解读：(1) 保守解读—— 当前实验范围内无 capacity threshold，routing 在所有测试 rank 上不显著；(2) 乐观解读 （open problem framing）——趋势暗示更高容量的专家可能使路由变得有意义，oracle gap 的存在支持这一推测。reframed paper 应采用解读 (2)，将其定位为 \\\"routing 的潜力需要 更好的 expert training 来释放\\\" 的 evidence。\\n\\n\\nRank sweep 显示路由收益从 r16 的 +1.0pp 缓慢增长到 r64 的 +2.0pp，但在任何 rank 上都不显著（p 最低 0.14）。worst 档假设为\\\"routing benefit is negligible at all ranks tested\\\"得到确认：即使在 r64（每 expert ~16M params）下，路由的 2.0pp 优势仍可能是 噪声。趋势微弱上升，暗示\\\"如果 rank 继续增大可能会显现显著差异\\\"，但在实验范围内 无法证实 capacity threshold 的存在。r64 的绝对性能值得注意：universal r64（65.5%） 已经超过 Meta-Brain r16（64.0%），进一步证实容量 > 路由。如果 rank 加倍的 universal 就能超过路由方案，那路由的工程成本更难以辩护。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Clean LIBERO evaluation — nominal performance preservation\",\n    \"description\": \"Evaluate Meta-Brain on standard (unperturbed) LIBERO to verify routing does not degrade nominal performance.\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"frozen_pi0_clean_libero\": 91.2,\n      \"meta_brain_clean_libero\": 87.0,\n      \"universal_r16_clean_libero\": 90.5,\n      \"universal_r48_clean_libero\": 89.8,\n      \"random_routing_clean_libero\": 88.2,\n      \"meta_brain_clean_delta\": -4.2,\n      \"r48_clean_delta\": -1.4,\n      \"r16_clean_delta\": -0.7,\n      \"random_routing_clean_delta\": -3.0,\n      \"meta_brain_clean_delta_p_value\": 0.02\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Clean LIBERO Evaluation (Nominal Performance)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Method\",\n            \"Clean LIBERO (%)\",\n            \"Δ vs Frozen (pp)\",\n            \"p-value\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Frozen pi0\",\n            \"91.2 ± 0.8\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Universal r16\",\n            \"90.5 ± 0.9\",\n            \"-0.7\",\n            \"0.31\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Universal r48\",\n            \"89.8 ± 1.0\",\n            \"-1.4\",\n            \"0.08\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Random routing\",\n            \"88.2 ± 1.2\",\n            \"-3.0\",\n            \"0.01\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Meta-Brain\",\n            \"87.0 ± 1.1\",\n            \"-4.2\",\n            \"0.002\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"-4.2pp clean degradation 是 worst 档中对部署叙事的最后一击。任何 practical system 需要在 perturbed 和 clean 条件下都表现良好。Meta-Brain 被 rank-48 universal 在 clean LIBERO 上支配（-1.4 vs -4.2），在 LIBERO-Plus 上又被追平。reframed paper 中应诚实 报告此 trade-off，并讨论 \\\"open-set routing with clean class\\\" 或 \\\"entropy-based routing gating\\\" 作为 future work 来缓解。\\n\\n\\nMeta-Brain 在 clean LIBERO 上掉 4.2pp（91.2→87.0%），且显著（p=0.02）。原因： 路由机制在无扰动输入上仍会激活——PAR router 将 clean observation 错误分类为某种扰动 类型（因为训练数据中没有 \\\"clean\\\" 类别），导致不必要的 LoRA 修正被应用。rank-48 universal 仅掉 1.4pp（89.8%），因为它学到的修正更温和（没有被路由放大）。random routing 掉 3.0pp——也低于 Meta-Brain 的 4.2pp，说明 PAR routing 在 clean input 上 的分类行为比 random 更有害（可能将 clean 集中路由到某个特定 expert，而 random 的 分散反而减轻了单一 expert 的干扰）。这一结果在 worst 档下对实际部署故事是致命的： routing 不仅没帮助（vs rank-48），还在正常条件下引入了可测量的性能退化。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cross-backbone validation — SmolVLA or OpenVLA\",\n    \"description\": \"Replicate Phase 0 + Phase 1 core pipeline on a second VLA backbone.\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"cross_backbone_target\": \"OpenVLA\",\n      \"phase0_3class_f1\": 0.952,\n      \"phase0_best_layer\": 8,\n      \"phase0_k1_f1\": 0.91,\n      \"phase1_universal_r16_overall\": 56.2,\n      \"phase1_meta_brain_overall\": 57.8,\n      \"phase1_routing_gap\": 1.6,\n      \"phase1_routing_gap_significant\": false,\n      \"phase0_linear_separability\": true,\n      \"layer_perturbation_mapping_consistent\": \"partial\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Cross-Backbone Validation Summary\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Metric\",\n            \"pi0 (PaliGemma)\",\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"Consistent?\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Phase 0 3-class F1\",\n            \"0.993\",\n            \"0.952\",\n            \"Yes (both >0.95)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Best probing layer\",\n            \"Layer 6/18\",\n            \"Layer 8/24\",\n            \"Yes (both ~1/3 depth)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"K=1 F1\",\n            \"0.898\",\n            \"0.910\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Routing benefit (pp)\",\n            \"+0.7 (vs r48)\",\n            \"+1.6 (vs r48)\",\n            \"Yes (both <2pp, n.s.)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"V→early, S→mid, P→late\",\n            \"Supported\",\n            \"Partial (V→early, P→late)\",\n            \"Partial\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cross-backbone 结果是 reframed paper 的重要支撑。虽然 routing 在两个 backbone 上都 失败了（进一步削弱 Claim 2），但 Phase 0 diagnostic finding 在两个 backbone 上都 复现——这强化了 reframing 的核心叙事\\\"VLA internals encode perturbation type\\\"。 应将此实验提升为 paper 的重要 evidence，特别是 dual t-SNE figure。\\n\\n\\nPhase 0 在 OpenVLA 上的 3-class F1=0.952（vs pi0 的 0.993），仍然很高但略低。 最佳层从 layer 6 (PaliGemma) 移到 layer 8，与 OpenVLA 的不同架构深度一致。K=1 F1=0.91（vs pi0 的 0.898）也相似。这证实了 Phase 0 的 mechanistic finding 是跨架构 普适的——perturbation type 信息编码在 VLA 内部表征中是一个一般性现象。Phase 1 的 routing gap（+1.6pp, 不显著）复现了 pi0 上的 worst-case 模式——路由在第二个 backbone 上同样无效。layer-perturbation mapping 部分一致（Visual→early 和 Physical→late 复现，Spatial→mid 不明显），可作为 partial corroboration。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LoRA layer placement ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"Vary which PaliGemma layers receive LoRA experts. Test V→early, S→mid, P→late hypothesis.\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"lora_v_early_2_6\": 65.5,\n      \"lora_v_mid_6_12\": 63.0,\n      \"lora_v_late_12_18\": 60.2,\n      \"lora_v_all_layers\": 67.0,\n      \"lora_s_early_2_6\": 57.0,\n      \"lora_s_mid_6_12\": 60.5,\n      \"lora_s_late_12_18\": 58.0,\n      \"lora_s_all_layers\": 62.0,\n      \"lora_p_early_2_6\": 48.5,\n      \"lora_p_mid_6_12\": 50.0,\n      \"lora_p_late_12_18\": 52.0,\n      \"lora_p_all_layers\": 55.5,\n      \"visual_prefers_early\": true,\n      \"spatial_prefers_mid\": true,\n      \"physical_prefers_late\": true,\n      \"best_subset_vs_all_layers_gap_avg\": -3.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Layer Placement Ablation (Success Rate %)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Expert\",\n            \"Early (2-6)\",\n            \"Mid (6-12)\",\n            \"Late (12-18)\",\n            \"All Layers\",\n            \"Best Subset\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LoRA-V\",\n            \"65.5\",\n            \"63.0\",\n            \"60.2\",\n            \"67.0\",\n            \"Early\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LoRA-S\",\n            \"57.0\",\n            \"60.5\",\n            \"58.0\",\n            \"62.0\",\n            \"Mid\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LoRA-P\",\n            \"48.5\",\n            \"50.0\",\n            \"52.0\",\n            \"55.5\",\n            \"Late\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Layer placement 结果是 reframed paper 的第二个 mechanistic finding。V→early/S→mid/ P→late 的层偏好与 Phase 0 的 probing 峰值对齐，共同构成\\\"VLA 内部按处理阶段编码 不同类型扰动信息\\\"的 narrative。在 reframed paper 中，此结果应被呈现为\\\"architecture design insight for future VLA robustness methods\\\"——即使当前路由无效，了解扰动信息 的空间分布对设计下一代 VLA 有价值。\\n\\nLayer placement 结果弱支持 V→early, S→mid, P→late 假设：LoRA-V 在 early 层 （65.5%）优于 mid（63.0%）和 late（60.2%）；LoRA-S 在 mid（60.5%）最佳；LoRA-P 在 late（52.0%）最佳。但关键问题是所有 subset placement 都显著低于 all-layers （差距 1.5-7pp），说明即使存在层偏好，全层覆盖的额外容量仍更重要。这与 worst 档 叙事一致——容量 > 精确定位。层偏好的存在为 Phase 0 的 mechanistic finding 提供了 支撑（early layers 处理视觉信息，late layers 处理动作规划），但不足以支持基于层 分配的架构设计——收益不值得精确定位的工程成本。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":1044,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1044}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011jmVkhBfvpUwRjKLd8aUbX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a thorough understanding of the data and the framing. Let me write the paper. The narrative guidance says:\n\n- Claim 2 collapses — rank-48 universal LoRA nearly matches Meta-Brain (<1pp gap), random routing within 2pp\n- Cross-type expert drops are small (3-6pp), experts learn largely interchangeable corrections\n- Oracle gap (6pp) hints at unrealized potential\n- Clean LIBERO shows measurable degradation (-4pp)\n- Radical reframing: lead with Phase 0 mechanistic finding as primary contribution, present routing experiments as honest negative result, position oracle gap as open problem\n\n\n- The paper's focus shifts to positioning this as diagnostic tools for understanding VLA robustness rather than a routing-based correction approach. Let me verify the output directory is set up.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3159,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17946,"cache_read_input_tokens":23113,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17946},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"009b5f02-a0d7-4a14-b176-7ec94b5b2bc9","uuid":"b8461db8-1ddc-4385-84fa-df91e7755f08"}
